      "Code": "# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n# =============================================================================\n# 3_CorreccionPendientes_v20  -  LYNKA  -  Civil 3D 2024 + Dynamo 2.19 (CPython3)\n#\n# Corrige las cotas de los extremos de las FeatureLines de trackers (FL_T*)\n# para que cada cuerda cumpla la pendiente maxima longitudinal, respetando:\n#   - escalon maximo en juntas entre trackers inmediatamente consecutivos\n#     (separacion en planta <= GAP_CONTIGUO); el limite real de cada junta es\n#     max(ESCALON_MAX, peldano natural del terreno) para NO tocar juntas sanas\n#   - huecos > GAP_CONTIGUO cortan la cadena (subcadenas independientes)\n#   - los dos puntos mas exteriores de cada eje quedan anclados a terreno;\n#     solo se mueven si es imprescindible y dentro de TOL_EXTREMOS, y si no\n#     llega, el eje se marca KO NO RESUELTO y no se toca\n#   - minimo movimiento total (desmonte Y terraplen permitidos); en empates\n#     se prefiere bajar el punto mas alto\n#   - cotas de terreno SIEMPRE recalculadas del MDT (idempotente)\n#   - solo se cambia la Z (XY intacto); cotas corregidas en rejilla de 1 cm\n#   - APLICAR=False => simulacion pura: no se modifica NADA, solo log\n#\n# INPUTS:\n#   IN[0]  MODO (\"NS\" / \"EO\")\n#   IN[1]  PATRON_FL (\"FL_T*\", '*' sufijo, ',' para varios)\n#   IN[2]  MDT (nombre superficie terreno)\n#   IN[3]  SUPERFICIE_TRACKERS (nombre; se reconstruye al final si APLICAR)\n#   IN[4]  PENDIENTE_MAX_NS (%)      IN[5]  PENDIENTE_MAX_EO (%)\n#   IN[6]  PITCH (m)                 IN[7]  MARGEN_PITCH (m)   [reservados v-transversal]\n#   IN[8]  ESCALON_MAX (m)           IN[9]  GAP_CONTIGUO (m)\n#   IN[10] TOL_EXTREMOS (m)          IN[11] TOL_AGRUPACION (m)\n#   IN[12] APLICAR (bool)\n#   IN[13] FASE (LONG | LONG+EO)   IN[14] FORZAR (True = cumplir todo)\n#   IN[15] MAX_PASADAS_EO          IN[16] SOLAPE_MIN (m)\n#   IN[17] RATIO D/T (objetivo)    IN[18] RUGOSIDAD (m)\n#   IN[19] TOL_RESCATE (m)         IN[20] TOL_RATIO (+-)\n#   IN[21] DEFLEXION_HINCA (%)  [flexibles: quiebro max por hinca]\n#   IN[22] DEFLEXION_ALA (%)    [flexibles: suma |quiebros| por ala]\n# OUT: log (conectar a Watch 1500x950)\n#\n# v05: FASE RESCATE opcional (TOL_RESCATE > 0). Tras la pasada normal, SOLO\n# lo que quedo KO se reintenta con condiciones mas libres: (a) ejes KO por\n# deficit -> anclas hasta +-TOL_RESCATE y, si ni asi, pendiente minima\n# factible (etiquetado RESCATADO con la p lograda); (b) pares EO KO ->\n# anclas ampliadas a +-TOL_RESCATE SOLO en los ejes implicados + barridos\n# extra (corte primero). Lo que cumplia con las condiciones estrictas no\n# se toca ni se relaja.\n#\n# v06: ARRASTRE TRANSVERSAL. Cuando los barridos convergen (o agotan\n# presupuesto) con pares KO, una DP global desplaza columnas ENTERAS\n# (preserva pendientes longitudinales y juntas) propagando el movimiento\n# por las vecinas dentro de SUS limites hasta donde hay holgura: las zonas\n# con margen absorben ('desahogan') a las rojas y las columnas sobradas ni\n# se mueven. En rescate, los topes de ancla se amplian a todo el\n# componente conectado con KOs (ampliar tope no es mover).\n#\n# v07: OBJETIVO DE TIERRAS. IN[16] pasa a ser el RATIO desmonte/terraplen\n# objetivo del MOV. DE TIERRAS (orientativo, banda +-TOL_RATIO). Un bucle\n# exterior ejecuta la optimizacion completa con distintos precios corte/\n# relleno (biseccion sobre una escalera, <=~5 pasadas) y adopta la que cae\n# en banda; si la geometria/anclas no lo permiten, adopta la mas cercana y\n# lo avisa. RATIO <= 0 desactiva el objetivo (pesos neutros).\n#\n# v08: PARES EN PUNTA. Mesas de columnas vecinas SIN solape suficiente\n# (escalones/diagonales de la implantacion) se emparejan por sus extremos\n# enfrentados si la diagonal en planta es <= 15 m (el lado de triangulo\n# del analisis de pendientes): desnivel limitado por p_trans x diagonal\n# REAL. Cierra los picos rojos de las zonas en escalera que antes quedaban\n# sin restriccion. Recomendado: PITCH=7, MARGEN=3 (ventana 4-10 m, igual\n# que el Slope Analysis).\n#\n# v09: GUARDARRAIL DE ORIENTACION (si salta el aviso de orientacion con\n# APLICAR=True, se fuerza simulacion y NO se escribe nada) + escalera de\n# precios refinada (peldanos 1/5, 1/7, 1/8) para que el objetivo de\n# tierras no salte por encima de la banda en plantas con pocas tierras.\n#\n# v10: AUTOPSIA DE PARES KO. Para cada par no resuelto, el log explica POR\n# QUE con numeros: cierre necesario, cuanto puede bajar el lado alto y\n# subir el bajo (modelo de desplazamiento uniforme de la cascada), que lo\n# limita (tope de ancla, tope MOV o el par vecino mas justo, con nombre y\n# margen) y veredicto: FALTAN X m ESTRUCTURAL o residuo de acople fino.\n#\n# v11: QUE TOCAR. Cuando algo queda KO, el log propone ACCIONES concretas\n# sobre los inputs con cifras: el TOL_RESCATE minimo que haria factible el\n# re-tilt (calculado ejecutando la propia cascada en modo simulacion con\n# topes ampliados), activar rescate para deficits, subir MAX_PASADAS en\n# residuos de acople, ampliar PITCH/MARGEN si hay huecos de cobertura, o\n# -- si ningun input llega -- el menu de implantacion cuantificado.\n# Son estimaciones estaticas: verificar siempre en dry-run.\n#\n# v12: QUE TOCAR con PRIORIDADES. Palancas modificables (unicas que se\n# recomiendan): P1 MAX_PASADAS_EO (solo tiempo, residuos de acople) ->\n# P2 TOL_RESCATE (tierras quirurgicas en lo KO; valor minimo calculado\n# ejecutando la cascada en modo simulacion) -> P3 TOL_EXTREMOS\n# (alternativa global, menos quirurgica) -> IMPLANTACION cuantificada si\n# ningun input llega. FIJOS por proyecto (nunca se recomiendan):\n# PITCH/MARGEN, TOL_AGRUPACION, GAP_CONTIGUO, SOLAPE_MIN, ESCALON_MAX,\n# RUGOSIDAD y PENDIENTES (la cobertura fuera de ventana pasa a linea\n# INFO). Estimaciones estaticas: verificar en dry-run.\n#\n# v13: RECETA + MODO FORZAR. Si quedan KOs, el RESUMEN imprime la RECETA\n# (valores explicitos de las palancas para cumplir TODA la planta):\n# estimada en fases normales, y VERIFICADA con FASE=FORZAR, que escala\n# solo P1 MAX_PASADAS y P2 TOL_RESCATE en reintentos completos\n# (respetando los inputs iniciales como punto de partida) hasta cumplir\n# todo o reportar los irreducibles como implantacion. En FORZAR el\n# objetivo de tierras se desactiva (el cumplimiento manda).\n#\n# v14: LOG A FICHERO. Cada ejecucion guarda el log completo en un .txt\n# (carpeta del DWG; si no es escribible, %TEMP%) con timestamp+PID, y la\n# ultima linea del Watch indica la ruta. Trazabilidad por pasada y fin de\n# los problemas de copiar/adjuntar el Watch.\n#\n# v15: FORZAR pasa a ser un INPUT propio (booleano, IN[14], debajo de\n# FASE). True = modo cumplir todo; por compatibilidad, escribir FORZAR\n# en FASE sigue funcionando.\n#\n# v16: ESCENARIOS COMPARATIVOS. Si la pasada real deja KOs (y no es modo\n# FORZAR), el script resuelve DE VERDAD dos casos automaticos sin\n# aplicarlos: CASO A quirurgico (EXTREMO actual + RESCATE = receta) y\n# CASO B global (EXTREMO = RESCATE = receta), y los tabula junto a la\n# fila REAL: KOs, tierras D/T, anclas movidas y dZmax, con la\n# conclusion 'cumple con menos tierras'. Ratio desactivado en los casos.\n#\n# v17: PRESUPUESTO Y TOPE ACORDES AL TOL. Con TOLs grandes los viajes\n# son largos: los ESCENARIOS, el FORZAR y la receta auto-escalan ahora\n# las pasadas (~25 + 20xTOL, tope 120) y el techo de movimiento EO pasa\n# a ser dinamico (max(1.0, TOL+0.5)). Corrige la paradoja de 'mas\n# libertad, mas KOs': eran corridas cortadas a mitad de redistribucion\n# (sintoma: terraplen ~0 con muchos KOs = etapa de rellenos abortada).\n#\n# v17: TECHO DE MOVIMIENTO EO DINAMICO. El tope interno de +-1.0 m sobre\n# el estado post-longitudinal pasa a max(1.0, tope_efectivo + 0.2), de\n# modo que TOL_EXTREMOS/TOL_RESCATE grandes (>1 m) se pueden ejercer de\n# verdad (antes quedaban estrangulados: maximos clavados en ~1.0). Ademas\n# los ESCENARIOS avisan cuando un caso sale peor que REAL (heuristica no\n# monotona).\n#\n# v18: PEINE EO (rescate por FILAS). Cuando relajacion y cascada dejan\n# pares KO, una DP exacta resuelve la FILA de mesas que cruza la\n# estacion del KO (W->E, un delta por MESA o grupo solidario, no por\n# columna): los topes salen de las anclas de ESA mesa, del techo MOV y\n# del margen de junta/escalon con sus vecinas N-S; la holgura de las\n# columnas con margen se ejerce de verdad y el rizado coordinado multi-\n# columna que el Gauss-Seidel no encuentra sale en un solo disparo. Si\n# el DP no llega, amplia el grupo mesa a mesa por las juntas (la cuna\n# se degrada por los escalones) y reintenta; solo ACEPTA resultados que\n# MEJORAN la verificacion global (sin regresiones posibles). Caso\n# origen: Estera, FL_T519<->FL_T520 (exceso 0.02 m irresoluble con 120\n# pasadas: la movilidad alcanzaba pero el acople por columnas no\n# convergia).\n#\n# v18: BANNER DE IMPOSIBILIDAD + MEJOR ESFUERZO. Si tras FORZAR + PEINE\n# quedan irreducibles, el log lo grita en un banner gigante y declara\n# el resultado de la corrida como MEJOR ESFUERZO explicito (aplicado o\n# disponible), con el peor par y el exceso total cuantificados.\n#\n# v18: GUARDARRAIL DE LIMITES SOSPECHOSOS. Antes de optimizar se mide\n# la pendiente longitudinal del terreno bajo los trackers (p50/p85):\n# si el p85 supera 2x el limite configurado, el log avisa de que los\n# limites probablemente NO son los de esta planta (leccion Apamate:\n# terreno 20-40% contra limites 6-10% por configuracion, no por\n# fisica).\n#\n# v19: WORK-LIST DE COLUMNAS SUCIAS. Los barridos EO solo re-resuelven\n# las columnas cuyo entorno cambio desde su ultima resolucion (vecinas\n# movidas, exigencia descartada o cambio de etapa): el resto esta en\n# su optimo local y re-resolverlo daria lo mismo. Mismo punto fijo,\n# fraccion del coste (el log reporta el ahorro). Los resets de etapa,\n# cascadas y peine re-ensucian todo.\n#\n# v19: BARRIDOS DE FILAS INTERMEDIOS. El peine deja de ser solo el\n# rescate final: al estancarse la relajacion (residuo <= 1 cm o ciclo)\n# y con la cascada sin efecto, se lanza un barrido de filas (hasta 3\n# por optimizacion, 6 filas por barrido) que cruza la planta en un\n# disparo de DP; si aplica algo, la relajacion por columnas continua\n# puliendo desde ese estado. Misma garantia del peine: solo acepta lo\n# que mejora la verificacion global.\n#\n# v20: TRACKERS FLEXIBLES (HINCAS). Clasificacion automatica por FL: 2\n# vertices = FIJO (todo como antes); >2 vertices = FLEXIBLE, cada vertice\n# interior es una HINCA. v22, segun ficha de fabricante:\n#   (1) TECHO ABSOLUTO: ningun vano supera la pendiente general del modo\n#       (NS/EO); la CUERDA (1a-ultima hinca) queda garantizada <= general y\n#       es la pendiente de referencia del analisis.\n#   (2) DEFLEXION por hinca: el cambio de pendiente entre el vano que llega\n#       y el que sale de cada hinca <= DEFLEXION_HINCA (%; 0,75 grados =\n#       1,31 %). Se impone tras el optimizador con un PULIDO por tracker\n#       (extremos fijos, minimo movimiento, solo-mejora).\n#   (3) DEFLEXION acumulada por ALA: suma de |quiebros| desde la hinca\n#       MOTORA (vertice interior mas cercano al punto medio; empate lado A)\n#       hasta cada extremo <= DEFLEXION_ALA (%; 8 grados = 13,96 %). El\n#       quiebro de la propia motora es origen de medida: NO computa en\n#       ningun ala (si respeta su limite individual).\n# Las hincas se mueven en Z como nodos\n# mas del optimizador (rugosidad, tierras, desmonte-primero, anclas de\n# columna, juntas, EO, cascada, peine y rescate: todo igual). La fase EO\n# usa el perfil REAL (polilinea) de cada mesa y comprueba tambien en cada\n# estacion de hinca dentro del solape. Las hincas se ESCRIBEN por su\n# indice de vertice real y se re-anclan a terreno si estaban desviadas.\n# DEFLEXION_HINCA y DEFLEXION_ALA son datos FIJOS de fabricante (no se\n# recomiendan como palancas).\n# Con todas las FL de 2 vertices el motor es bit-a-bit identico a v19.\nimport sys\nimport time\nimport math\nimport traceback\n\nimport clr\nclr.AddReference('AcMgd')\nclr.AddReference('AcCoreMgd')\nclr.AddReference('AcDbMgd')\nclr.AddReference('AecBaseMgd')\nclr.AddReference('AeccDbMgd')\n\nfrom Autodesk.AutoCAD.ApplicationServices import Application as AcadApp\nfrom Autodesk.AutoCAD.DatabaseServices import (OpenMode, BlockTableRecord,\n                                               SymbolUtilityServices)\nfrom Autodesk.Civil.ApplicationServices import CivilApplication\nfrom Autodesk.Civil.DatabaseServices import FeatureLine, TinSurface\n\n# --- enum FeatureLinePointType: vive en Autodesk.Civil (patron confirmado),\n#     con fallback por reflexion sobre todos los ensamblados cargados --------\nPIPOINT = None\ntry:\n    from Autodesk.Civil import FeatureLinePointType\n    PIPOINT = FeatureLinePointType.PIPoint\nexcept Exception:\n    try:\n        import System\n        for _asm in System.AppDomain.CurrentDomain.GetAssemblies():\n            _found = None\n            try:\n                for _tp in _asm.GetTypes():\n                    if _tp.IsEnum and _tp.Name == 'FeatureLinePointType':\n                        _found = _tp\n                        break\n            except Exception:\n                continue\n            if _found is not None:\n                PIPOINT = System.Enum.Parse(_found, 'PIPoint')\n                break\n    except Exception:\n        PIPOINT = None\n\n\n# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n# =============================================================================\n# NUCLEO DE OPTIMIZACION (puro Python, sin Civil 3D) - Script 3 v02\n#\n# FASE LONG (v01, intacta): por (sub)cadena de nodos (extremos de trackers\n# ordenados a lo largo del eje):\n#     minimizar  sum_i |z_i - t_i|      (desmonte Y terraplen permitidos)\n#     sujeto a   |z_i - z_{i-1}| <= b_i (pendiente por tracker / escalon\n#                                        en juntas contiguas)\n#                z_j = valor fijo       (extremos exteriores anclados)\n# DP EXACTA en enteros sobre rejilla de 1 cm; desempate a la cota mas baja\n# (\"baja el punto mas alto\").\n#\n# FASE EO (v02): acopla columnas vecinas (emparejadas por PITCH+-MARGEN y\n# solape a lo largo del eje >= SOLAPE_MIN). Restriccion por par de mesas:\n# |Z_i(s) - Z_j(s)| <= p_trans * d en todo el solape; como ambas cuerdas son\n# rectas, basta exigirlo en los DOS EXTREMOS del solape. Resolucion por\n# barridos alternos (descenso por bloques-columna): cada columna se\n# re-resuelve con la MISMA DP exacta anadiendo cajas [lo,hi] por nodo\n# derivadas de las vecinas en su estado actual. Garantiza SIEMPRE la fase\n# longitudinal; la transversal se verifica par a par al final y los pares\n# irresolubles (tipicamente entre extremos anclados) se listan como KO.\n# =============================================================================\n\nGRID = 0.01          # rejilla de cotas (m)\nINF_I = 10 ** 15     # infinito entero para la DP\nK_LEX = 10 ** 6      # jerarquia: mov. tierras (fuera de rugosidad)\n                     # domina; desviacion v03 solo desempata\n\n\ndef _round_half_up(x):\n    import math\n    return int(math.floor(x + 0.5))\n\n\ndef _to_k(v, z_ref):\n    return _round_half_up((v - z_ref) / GRID)\n\n\ndef _sliding_min(a, w):\n    \"\"\"g[k] = min(a[max(0,k-w) .. min(n-1,k+w)]) con deque, O(n).\"\"\"\n    from collections import deque\n    n = len(a)\n    if w <= 0:\n        return list(a)\n    g = [0] * n\n    dq = deque()\n    j = 0\n    for k in range(n):\n        hi = k + w\n        if hi > n - 1:\n            hi = n - 1\n        while j <= hi:\n            aj = a[j]\n            while dq and a[dq[-1]] >= aj:\n                dq.pop()\n            dq.append(j)\n            j += 1\n        lo = k - w\n        while dq[0] < lo:\n            dq.popleft()\n        g[k] = a[dq[0]]\n    return g\n\n\ndef solve_chain_grid(tk, wsteps, fixed, boxes=None, pesos=None, rug=0):\n    \"\"\"DP exacta en enteros.\n    tk     : list[int]  cota objetivo (indice de rejilla) por nodo.\n    wsteps : list[int]  len n-1, holgura maxima |k_i - k_{i-1}| por arista.\n    fixed  : dict {idx: k}  nodos clavados a un valor exacto (ignoran cajas).\n    boxes  : dict {idx: (lo_k, hi_k)} cajas por nodo. Opcional.\n    pesos  : list[(w_dn, w_up)] por nodo. Coste = w_dn*(t-k) si k<t (DESMONTE)\n             o w_up*(k-t) si k>t (TERRAPLEN). None = (1,1) simetrico.\n    Devuelve list[int] zk optima o None si es infactible.\n    Desempate: cota mas baja entre optimos (prioriza desmonte tambien ahi).\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(tk)\n    vals = list(tk) + list(fixed.values())\n    if boxes:\n        for (lo, hi) in boxes.values():\n            vals.append(lo)\n            vals.append(hi)\n    kmin = min(vals) - 1\n    kmax = max(vals) + 1\n    S = kmax - kmin + 1\n\n    def node_cost(i, F_shift):\n        out = [INF_I] * S\n        if i in fixed:\n            kf = fixed[i] - kmin\n            if 0 <= kf < S and F_shift[kf] < INF_I:\n                out[kf] = F_shift[kf]\n            return out\n        lo, hi = 0, S - 1\n        if boxes is not None and i in boxes:\n            blo, bhi = boxes[i]\n            if blo - kmin > lo:\n                lo = blo - kmin\n            if bhi - kmin < hi:\n                hi = bhi - kmin\n            if lo > hi:\n                return out\n        ti = tk[i] - kmin\n        if pesos is None:\n            wd = wu = 1\n        else:\n            wd, wu = pesos[i]\n        for k in range(lo, hi + 1):\n            base = F_shift[k]\n            if base < INF_I:\n                d = k - ti\n                if d >= 0:\n                    exc = d - rug\n                    c = wu * (K_LEX * (exc if exc > 0 else 0) + d)\n                else:\n                    dd = -d\n                    exc = dd - rug\n                    c = wd * (K_LEX * (exc if exc > 0 else 0) + dd)\n                out[k] = base + c\n        return out\n\n    F = []\n    zeros = [0] * S\n    F.append(node_cost(0, zeros))\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        g = _sliding_min(F[i - 1], wsteps[i - 1])\n        F.append(node_cost(i, g))\n\n    last = F[n - 1]\n    best = INF_I\n    kbest = -1\n    for k in range(S):\n        if last[k] < best:\n            best = last[k]\n            kbest = k\n    if best >= INF_I:\n        return None\n\n    zk = [0] * n\n    zk[n - 1] = kbest\n    for i in range(n - 1, 0, -1):\n        w = wsteps[i - 1]\n        lo = zk[i] - w\n        hi = zk[i] + w\n        if lo < 0:\n            lo = 0\n        if hi > S - 1:\n            hi = S - 1\n        Fi = F[i - 1]\n        bb = INF_I\n        kb = -1\n        for k in range(lo, hi + 1):\n            if Fi[k] < bb:\n                bb = Fi[k]\n                kb = k\n        zk[i - 1] = kb\n    return [k + kmin for k in zk]\n\n\n# =============================================================================\n# PREPARAR / RESOLVER / CLASIFICAR un eje (fase LONG identica a v01)\n# =============================================================================\ndef EXT(prep, j):\n    \"\"\"Indice real en la cadena del extremo j (convencion 2i=A, 2i+1=B).\n    Con trackers fijos es la identidad.\"\"\"\n    m = prep.get('ext')\n    return j if m is None else m[j]\n\n\ndef preparar_eje(trs, p_frac, escalon_m, gap_cont_m, tol_ext_m,\n                 w_fill=3, w_anc=10, rug_m=0.0, w_cut=1, p_hincas=None):\n    \"\"\"Construye la estructura del eje. trs ORDENADOS a lo largo del eje;\n    extremo A = primero en el sentido del eje.\n    Tracker FIJO (sin 'h' o vacio): cadena A-B con arista de mesa p_frac.\n    Tracker FLEXIBLE (tr['h'] = [(x,y,z_t),...] hincas interiores):\n    cadena A-h1-..-hk-B con una arista por vano a p_hincas (el limite de\n    CUERDA vs pendiente general queda garantizado aguas arriba capando\n    p_hincas <= p_frac). 'ext' mapea la convencion 2i/2i+1 al indice real.\"\"\"\n    import math\n    n = len(trs)\n    ko = {'status': 'KO', 'res': [], 'anc': {'a_mov': None, 'b_mov': None},\n          'stats': {}, 'n': n, 'trs': trs}\n    if n == 0:\n        ko['msg'] = 'eje sin trackers'\n        return ko\n    for tr in trs:\n        if tr['len'] < 0.05:\n            ko['msg'] = ('tracker {} con longitud en planta {:.3f} m (<0.05)'\n                         .format(tr['id'], tr['len']))\n            return ko\n    if p_hincas is None:\n        p_hincas = p_frac\n\n    t_ex = []\n    ext = []\n    ns_de = []          # por tracker: lista de indices de sus nodos\n    flex = []\n    for tr in trs:\n        hs = tr.get('h') or []\n        i0 = len(t_ex)\n        t_ex.append(tr['az_t'])\n        for h in hs:\n            t_ex.append(h[2])\n        t_ex.append(tr['bz_t'])\n        i1 = len(t_ex) - 1\n        ext.append(i0)\n        ext.append(i1)\n        ns_de.append(list(range(i0, i1 + 1)))\n        flex.append(len(hs) > 0)\n\n    z_ref = _round_half_up(min(t_ex) * 100.0) / 100.0\n    tk = [_to_k(v, z_ref) for v in t_ex]\n\n    esc_steps = int((escalon_m + 1e-9) / GRID)\n    edges = []\n    for i, tr in enumerate(trs):\n        if flex[i]:\n            pts = [(tr['ax'], tr['ay'])] + [(h[0], h[1]) for h in tr['h']] \\\n                + [(tr['bx'], tr['by'])]\n            for q in range(len(pts) - 1):\n                ds = math.hypot(pts[q + 1][0] - pts[q][0],\n                                pts[q + 1][1] - pts[q][1])\n                if ds < 0.05:\n                    ds = 0.05\n                edges.append(('H', int((p_hincas * ds + 1e-9) / GRID)))\n        else:\n            edges.append(('T', int((p_frac * tr['len'] + 1e-9) / GRID)))\n        if i < n - 1:\n            g = math.hypot(trs[i + 1]['ax'] - tr['bx'],\n                           trs[i + 1]['ay'] - tr['by'])\n            if g <= gap_cont_m:\n                nat = abs(tk[ext[2 * i + 1]] - tk[ext[2 * i + 2]])\n                edges.append(('J', max(esc_steps, nat)))\n            else:\n                edges.append(('X', 0))\n\n    N = len(t_ex)\n    jidx = {}\n    for j, (tipo, _) in enumerate(edges):\n        if tipo in ('J', 'X'):\n            jidx[len(jidx)] = j\n    subch = []\n    start = 0\n    for j, (tipo, _) in enumerate(edges):\n        if tipo == 'X':\n            subch.append((start, j))\n            start = j + 1\n    subch.append((start, N - 1))\n\n    tol_steps = int((tol_ext_m + 1e-9) / GRID)\n    last = N - 1\n    anc_box = {0: (tk[0] - tol_steps, tk[0] + tol_steps),\n               last: (tk[last] - tol_steps, tk[last] + tol_steps)}\n    pesos = [(w_cut, w_fill)] * N\n    pesos[0] = (w_anc * w_cut, w_anc * w_fill)\n    pesos[last] = (w_anc * w_cut, w_anc * w_fill)\n\n    if len(subch) == 1:\n        wsum = 0\n        for (tipo, w) in edges:\n            wsum += w\n        need = abs(tk[0] - tk[last]) - wsum\n        if need > 2 * tol_steps:\n            ko['msg'] = ('deficit de pendiente: hay que mover los '\n                         'extremos {:.2f} m en total y TOL_EXTREMOS '\n                         '({:.2f} m por extremo) no llega. Sube la '\n                         'tolerancia o revisa el eje.').format(\n                             need * GRID, tol_ext_m)\n            ko['stats'] = {'deficit_m': need * GRID}\n            return ko\n\n    return {'status': 'OK', 'msg': '', 'n': n, 'trs': trs,\n            'p_frac': p_frac, 'p_hincas': p_hincas, 't_ex': t_ex,\n            'z_ref': z_ref, 'tk': tk, 'edges': edges, 'subch': subch,\n            'fixed': {}, 'anc_box': anc_box, 'pesos': pesos,\n            'rug': int((rug_m + 1e-9) / GRID),\n            'ext': ext, 'ns_de': ns_de, 'flex': flex, 'jidx': jidx,\n            'anc': {'a_mov': None, 'b_mov': None}}\n\n\ndef resolver_eje(prep, boxes=None):\n    \"\"\"Resuelve las subcadenas del eje. boxes: {idx_global: (lo_k, hi_k)}\n    (exigencias EO). El tope duro de las anclas (anc_box, +-TOL) se fusiona\n    SIEMPRE: si una exigencia EO cae fuera del tope, se pega al borde del\n    tope (las anclas nunca superan TOL_EXTREMOS).\"\"\"\n    n = prep['n']\n    tk = prep['tk']\n    edges = prep['edges']\n    zk = [None] * len(prep['tk'])\n    for (s, e) in prep['subch']:\n        tks = tk[s:e + 1]\n        ws = [edges[j][1] for j in range(s, e)]\n        pes = prep['pesos'][s:e + 1]\n        bx = {}\n        for i, v in prep['anc_box'].items():\n            if s <= i <= e:\n                bx[i - s] = v\n        if boxes:\n            for i, v in boxes.items():\n                if s <= i <= e:\n                    li = i - s\n                    lo, hi = v\n                    if li in bx:\n                        alo, ahi = bx[li]\n                        nlo = lo if lo > alo else alo\n                        nhi = hi if hi < ahi else ahi\n                        if nlo > nhi:\n                            nlo = nhi = (ahi if lo > ahi else alo)\n                        bx[li] = (nlo, nhi)\n                    else:\n                        bx[li] = (lo, hi)\n        sol = solve_chain_grid(tks, ws, {}, bx if bx else None, pes,\n                               prep.get('rug', 0))\n        if sol is None:\n            return None\n        for off, k in enumerate(sol):\n            zk[s + off] = k\n    return zk\n\n\ndef z_eff(prep, zk, i):\n    \"\"\"Cota efectiva REAL del nodo i (indice REAL de la cadena): rejilla si\n    se toca, terreno exacto si queda intacto (los intactos no se escriben).\n    Para extremos con la convencion 2i/2i+1 usar z_ext().\"\"\"\n    if zk[i] != prep['tk'][i]:\n        return round(prep['z_ref'] + zk[i] * GRID, 2)\n    return prep['t_ex'][i]\n\n\ndef z_ext(prep, zk, j):\n    \"\"\"Cota efectiva del EXTREMO j (convencion 2i=A, 2i+1=B), traducido al\n    indice real via EXT (identidad con trackers fijos).\"\"\"\n    return z_eff(prep, zk, EXT(prep, j))\n\n\nDEFLEX_CFG = {'d_h': 0.0131, 'd_ala': 0.1396}\n\n\ndef _geom_flex(prep, i):\n    \"\"\"(pts_xy, ds, z_terreno, idx_motora) del tracker flexible i.\n    Motora = vertice interior mas cercano al punto medio de la longitud\n    (empate: lado A). Indices sobre la polilinea 0..k+1 (0=A, k+1=B).\"\"\"\n    import math\n    tr = prep['trs'][i]\n    hs = tr['h']\n    pts = [(tr['ax'], tr['ay'])] + [(h[0], h[1]) for h in hs] \\\n        + [(tr['bx'], tr['by'])]\n    z_t = [tr['az_t']] + [h[2] for h in hs] + [tr['bz_t']]\n    ds = []\n    for q in range(len(pts) - 1):\n        d = math.hypot(pts[q + 1][0] - pts[q][0],\n                       pts[q + 1][1] - pts[q][1])\n        ds.append(d if d > 0.05 else 0.05)\n    total = sum(ds)\n    st = [0.0]\n    for d in ds:\n        st.append(st[-1] + d)\n    m = 1\n    best = None\n    for j in range(1, len(pts) - 1):\n        dist = abs(st[j] - total / 2.0)\n        if best is None or dist < best - 1e-9:\n            best = dist\n            m = j\n    return pts, ds, z_t, m\n\n\ndef _deflex_tracker(zs, ds, m, d_h, d_ala, hold=0.0):\n    \"\"\"Evalua deflexiones: (quiebro_max, ala_A, ala_B, n_ko_quiebro,\n    n_ko_ala). El quiebro de la motora (vertice m) NO computa en las alas\n    pero SI en el maximo/KO individual. hold = holgura absoluta extra.\"\"\"\n    ps = [(zs[q + 1] - zs[q]) / ds[q] for q in range(len(ds))]\n    qmax = 0.0\n    n_ko_q = 0\n    ala_a = 0.0\n    ala_b = 0.0\n    for j in range(1, len(zs) - 1):\n        qb = abs(ps[j] - ps[j - 1])\n        if qb > qmax:\n            qmax = qb\n        if qb > d_h + 0.012 / min(ds[j - 1], ds[j]) + hold + 1e-9:\n            n_ko_q += 1\n        if j < m:\n            ala_a += qb\n        elif j > m:\n            ala_b += qb\n    n_ko_a = 0\n    for v in (ala_a, ala_b):\n        if v > d_ala + hold + 1e-9:\n            n_ko_a += 1\n    return qmax, ala_a, ala_b, n_ko_q, n_ko_a\n\n\ndef _pulir_tracker(z_obj, z_cur, ds, m, p_max, d_h, d_ala):\n    \"\"\"Reajusta las hincas interiores (extremos fijos) para cumplir\n    quiebro <= d_h y suma de |quiebros| por ala <= d_ala (motora excluida),\n    manteniendo cada vano <= p_max y moviendose lo minimo respecto a z_obj\n    (el objetivo original, normalmente el terreno). Barrido de proyeccion\n    por intervalos + endurecimiento progresivo si el ala no cumple.\n    Devuelve (z_nueva, d_h_efectivo).\"\"\"\n    n = len(z_cur)\n    z = list(z_cur)\n    d_eff = d_h\n\n    def _intervalo(j, dh):\n        lo = -1e18\n        hi = 1e18\n        # vanos j-1 y j contra p_max\n        lo = max(lo, z[j - 1] - p_max * ds[j - 1])\n        hi = min(hi, z[j - 1] + p_max * ds[j - 1])\n        lo = max(lo, z[j + 1] - p_max * ds[j])\n        hi = min(hi, z[j + 1] + p_max * ds[j])\n        # quiebro en j: |(z[j+1]-zj)/ds[j] - (zj-z[j-1])/ds[j-1]| <= dh\n        a = 1.0 / ds[j] + 1.0 / ds[j - 1]\n        b = z[j + 1] / ds[j] + z[j - 1] / ds[j - 1]\n        lo = max(lo, (b - dh) / a)\n        hi = min(hi, (b + dh) / a)\n        # quiebro en j-1 (si es interior): zj solo entra en p_{j-1}\n        if j - 1 >= 1:\n            p_prev = (z[j - 1] - z[j - 2]) / ds[j - 2]\n            lo = max(lo, z[j - 1] + (p_prev - dh) * ds[j - 1])\n            hi = min(hi, z[j - 1] + (p_prev + dh) * ds[j - 1])\n        # quiebro en j+1 (si es interior): zj solo entra en p_j\n        if j + 1 <= n - 2:\n            p_next = (z[j + 2] - z[j + 1]) / ds[j + 1]\n            lo = max(lo, z[j + 1] - (p_next + dh) * ds[j])\n            hi = min(hi, z[j + 1] - (p_next - dh) * ds[j])\n        return lo, hi\n\n    for _ronda in range(40):\n        for _sweep in range(60):\n            cambio = 0.0\n            for j in range(1, n - 1):\n                lo, hi = _intervalo(j, d_eff)\n                if lo > hi:\n                    zj = (lo + hi) / 2.0\n                else:\n                    zj = z_obj[j]\n                    if zj < lo:\n                        zj = lo\n                    elif zj > hi:\n                        zj = hi\n                if abs(zj - z[j]) > 1e-6:\n                    cambio = max(cambio, abs(zj - z[j]))\n                    z[j] = zj\n            if cambio < 1e-5:\n                break\n        qmax, ala_a, ala_b, ko_q, ko_a = _deflex_tracker(\n            z, ds, m, d_h, d_ala)\n        if ko_q == 0 and ko_a == 0:\n            return z, d_eff\n        d_eff *= 0.7\n        if d_eff < 1e-4:\n            break\n    # ultimo recurso: tubo recto A-B (siempre factible: cuerda <= p_max)\n    st = [0.0]\n    for d in ds:\n        st.append(st[-1] + d)\n    total = st[-1]\n    z = [z[0] + (z[n - 1] - z[0]) * (st[j] / total) for j in range(n)]\n    return z, 0.0\n\n\ndef _z_eff_tracker(prep, zk, i):\n    \"\"\"Cotas efectivas actuales de la polilinea del tracker i.\"\"\"\n    nodos = prep['ns_de'][i]\n    pts, ds, z_t, m = _geom_flex(prep, i)\n    zs = []\n    for q, idx in enumerate(nodos):\n        if zk[idx] != prep['tk'][idx]:\n            zs.append(prep['z_ref'] + zk[idx] * GRID)\n        else:\n            zs.append(z_t[q])\n    return nodos, ds, z_t, m, zs\n\n\ndef _aplicar_shift(prep, zk, i, s_m):\n    \"\"\"Desplaza en bloque (uniforme) todas las cotas del tracker i.\n    Un shift uniforme conserva pendientes de vano, quiebros y alas.\"\"\"\n    nodos, ds, z_t, m, zs = _z_eff_tracker(prep, zk, i)\n    for q, idx in enumerate(nodos):\n        zk[idx] = int(round((zs[q] + s_m - prep['z_ref']) / GRID))\n\n\ndef _ventana_shift(prep, zk, i):\n    \"\"\"Intervalo de shift uniforme admisible del tracker i: anclas de\n    extremos (terreno +- tol_ext) y escalon con los contiguos del eje.\"\"\"\n    tol = DEFLEX_CFG.get('tol_ext', 0.0)\n    esc = DEFLEX_CFG.get('esc', 0.15)\n    gapc = DEFLEX_CFG.get('gapc', 5.0)\n    import math\n    nodos, ds, z_t, m, zs = _z_eff_tracker(prep, zk, i)\n    lo = -1e9\n    hi = 1e9\n    # anclas: extremos dentro de terreno +- tol (mas margen de rejilla)\n    for q in (0, len(nodos) - 1):\n        lo = max(lo, (z_t[q] - tol) - zs[q] - 0.006)\n        hi = min(hi, (z_t[q] + tol) - zs[q] + 0.006)\n    # escalon con contiguos (mismo eje)\n    trs = prep['trs']\n    tr = trs[i]\n    for j, o in enumerate(trs):\n        if j == i or not prep['flex'][j] and False:\n            continue\n        if j == i:\n            continue\n        # distancia entre extremos enfrentados en planta\n        d1 = math.hypot(tr['ax'] - o['bx'], tr['ay'] - o['by'])\n        d2 = math.hypot(tr['bx'] - o['ax'], tr['by'] - o['ay'])\n        if min(d1, d2) > gapc:\n            continue\n        nod_o, ds_o, zt_o, m_o, zs_o = _z_eff_tracker(prep, zk, j)\n        if d1 <= d2:\n            z_mio, z_suyo = zs[0], zs_o[-1]\n        else:\n            z_mio, z_suyo = zs[-1], zs_o[0]\n        lo = max(lo, (z_suyo - esc) - z_mio - 0.006)\n        hi = min(hi, (z_suyo + esc) - z_mio + 0.006)\n    return lo, hi\n\n\ndef _reconciliar_flex(preps, zks, pares, p_trans, rep):\n    \"\"\"Tras el pulido coordinado: resuelve pares EO rotos moviendo mesas\n    ENTERAS (shift uniforme, conserva deflexiones) dentro de sus ventanas\n    de ancla y escalon. Greedy con aceptacion solo-mejora por par.\"\"\"\n    if not pares:\n        return\n    for _sweep in range(6):\n        kos = verificar_pares(preps, zks, pares, p_trans)\n        if not kos:\n            break\n        mejoro = False\n        vistos = set()\n        for ko in kos:\n            par = pares[ko['pi']]\n            clave = (ko['pi'],)\n            if clave in vistos:\n                continue\n            vistos.add(clave)\n            lados = [(par['ea'], par['ta']), (par['eb'], par['tb'])]\n            # cota de cada lado en la estacion del KO\n            e_a, t_a = lados[0]\n            e_b, t_b = lados[1]\n            za = perfil_z(preps[e_a], zks[e_a], t_a, ko['s'], par['modo'])\n            zb = perfil_z(preps[e_b], zks[e_b], t_b, ko['s'], par['modo'])\n            nece = ko['exceso'] + 0.005\n            alto, bajo = (0, 1) if za > zb else (1, 0)\n            plan = []\n            # bajar el alto y/o subir el bajo, repartido por holgura real\n            for lado, signo in ((alto, -1.0), (bajo, +1.0)):\n                e_i, t_i = lados[lado]\n                lo, hi = _ventana_shift(preps[e_i], zks[e_i], t_i)\n                disp = (-lo) if signo < 0 else hi\n                plan.append((e_i, t_i, signo, max(0.0, disp)))\n            total = plan[0][3] + plan[1][3]\n            if total < nece - 1e-9:\n                continue\n            resto = nece\n            for e_i, t_i, signo, disp in plan:\n                mov = min(disp, resto)\n                if mov <= 1e-6:\n                    continue\n                antes = len(verificar_pares(preps, zks, pares, p_trans))\n                _aplicar_shift(preps[e_i], zks[e_i], t_i, signo * mov)\n                despues = len(verificar_pares(preps, zks, pares,\n                                              p_trans))\n                if despues > antes:\n                    _aplicar_shift(preps[e_i], zks[e_i], t_i,\n                                   -signo * mov)\n                else:\n                    resto -= mov\n                    mejoro = True\n                    rep['shifts'] += 1\n                    if mov > rep['shift_max']:\n                        rep['shift_max'] = mov\n                if resto <= 1e-6:\n                    break\n        if not mejoro:\n            break\n\n\ndef _pulir_deflexiones_planta(preps, zks, pares, p_trans):\n    \"\"\"v24: pulido COORDINADO en dos pasadas. (1) Se pulen TODOS los\n    trackers flexibles de la planta (sin guardia: los ejes vecinos, con\n    terreno parecido, se alisan de forma parecida y se mueven coherentes).\n    (2) Los pares EO que queden rotos se reconcilian con desplazamientos\n    uniformes por mesa (conservan deflexiones) dentro de anclas/escalon.\n    Los pares restantes se reportan. Deflexiones = restriccion dura;\n    tierras = objetivo (cada hinca se mueve lo minimo del terreno).\"\"\"\n    d_h = DEFLEX_CFG['d_h']\n    d_ala = DEFLEX_CFG['d_ala']\n    rep = {'ejes_tocados': 0, 'trackers_pulidos': 0, 'hincas_ajustadas': 0,\n           'dz_max_pulido': 0.0, 'rectos': 0, 'conflictos': [],\n           'shifts': 0, 'shift_max': 0.0,\n           'pares_ko_antes': 0, 'pares_ko_despues': 0,\n           'd_h': d_h, 'd_ala': d_ala}\n    if pares:\n        rep['pares_ko_antes'] = len(\n            verificar_pares(preps, zks, pares, p_trans))\n    # ---- pasada 1: pulir toda la planta ----\n    for e, prep in enumerate(preps):\n        if prep['status'] != 'OK' or zks[e] is None:\n            continue\n        if not prep.get('flex') or not any(prep['flex']):\n            continue\n        zk = zks[e]\n        tocado_eje = False\n        for i, tr in enumerate(prep['trs']):\n            if not prep['flex'][i]:\n                continue\n            nodos = prep['ns_de'][i]\n            pts, ds, z_t, m = _geom_flex(prep, i)\n            z_cur = []\n            for q, idx in enumerate(nodos):\n                if zk[idx] != prep['tk'][idx]:\n                    z_cur.append(prep['z_ref'] + zk[idx] * GRID)\n                else:\n                    z_cur.append(z_t[q])\n            qmax, aa, ab, ko_q, ko_a = _deflex_tracker(\n                z_cur, ds, m, d_h, d_ala)\n            if ko_q == 0 and ko_a == 0:\n                continue\n            z_new, d_eff = _pulir_tracker(z_t, z_cur, ds, m,\n                                          prep['p_frac'], d_h, d_ala)\n            n_adj = 0\n            for q, idx in enumerate(nodos):\n                if q == 0 or q == len(nodos) - 1:\n                    continue\n                k_new = int(round((z_new[q] - prep['z_ref']) / GRID))\n                if k_new != zk[idx]:\n                    dzp = abs(z_new[q] - z_cur[q])\n                    if dzp > rep['dz_max_pulido']:\n                        dzp2 = dzp\n                        rep['dz_max_pulido'] = dzp\n                    zk[idx] = k_new\n                    n_adj += 1\n            if n_adj:\n                rep['trackers_pulidos'] += 1\n                rep['hincas_ajustadas'] += n_adj\n                tocado_eje = True\n                if d_eff == 0.0:\n                    rep['rectos'] += 1\n        if tocado_eje:\n            rep['ejes_tocados'] += 1\n    # ---- pasada 2: reconciliar pares con shifts uniformes ----\n    if pares:\n        _reconciliar_flex(preps, zks, pares, p_trans, rep)\n        rep['pares_ko_despues'] = len(\n            verificar_pares(preps, zks, pares, p_trans))\n    return rep\n\n\ndef clasificar_eje(prep, zk, zk_long=None):\n    \"\"\"Salida por tracker + stats (formato v01). Si zk_long se aporta,\n    distingue clase 'EO' (intacto tras fase LONG, movido tras fase EO).\n    Trackers FLEXIBLES: ademas 'hz' (cotas finales de hincas), 'hdz'\n    (deltas), 'vanos_ko_antes/despues' y 's_vano_antes/despues'. v21: la\n    pendiente reportada de una mesa flexible es la de su CUERDA (primera a\n    ultima hinca) contra la pendiente general; los vanos se comprueban\n    aparte contra p_hincas.\"\"\"\n    import math\n    trs = prep['trs']\n    tk = prep['tk']\n    res = []\n    rug_v = prep.get('rug', 0) * GRID\n    p_h = prep.get('p_hincas', prep['p_frac'])\n    stats = {'violaban': 0, 'corregidos': 0, 'arrastrados': 0,\n             'ajuste_eo': 0, 'sin_tocar': 0, 'dz_max': 0.0, 'dz_max_id': '',\n             'suma_desmonte': 0.0, 'suma_terraplen': 0.0,\n             'mt_desmonte': 0.0, 'mt_terraplen': 0.0, 'absorbidos': 0,\n             's_max_antes': 0.0, 's_max_despues': 0.0,\n             'subcadenas': len(prep['subch']),\n             'flex': 0, 'hincas': 0, 'vanos': 0, 'vanos_ko_antes': 0,\n             'vanos_ko_despues': 0, 'cuerda_ko_antes': 0,\n             'cuerda_ko_despues': 0, 'q_ko_a': 0, 'q_ko_d': 0,\n             'ala_ko_a': 0, 'ala_ko_d': 0, 'qmax_a': 0.0, 'qmax_d': 0.0,\n             'alamax_a': 0.0, 'alamax_d': 0.0, 'hincas_movidas': 0,\n             'h_desmonte': 0.0, 'h_terraplen': 0.0, 'h_absorbidos': 0}\n\n    def contab(dz, tid):\n        if abs(dz) > abs(stats['dz_max']):\n            stats['dz_max'] = dz\n            stats['dz_max_id'] = tid\n        if dz < 0:\n            stats['suma_desmonte'] += -dz\n            if -dz > rug_v + 1e-9:\n                stats['mt_desmonte'] += (-dz - rug_v)\n            else:\n                stats['absorbidos'] += 1\n        elif dz > 0:\n            stats['suma_terraplen'] += dz\n            if dz > rug_v + 1e-9:\n                stats['mt_terraplen'] += (dz - rug_v)\n            else:\n                stats['absorbidos'] += 1\n\n    for i, tr in enumerate(trs):\n        ia, ib = EXT(prep, 2 * i), EXT(prep, 2 * i + 1)\n        wa = zk[ia] != tk[ia]\n        wb = zk[ib] != tk[ib]\n        za = round(prep['z_ref'] + zk[ia] * GRID, 2) if wa else tr['az_t']\n        zb = round(prep['z_ref'] + zk[ib] * GRID, 2) if wb else tr['bz_t']\n        dza = (za - tr['az_t']) if wa else 0.0\n        dzb = (zb - tr['bz_t']) if wb else 0.0\n        es_flex = bool(prep.get('flex') and prep['flex'][i])\n        if es_flex:\n            hs = tr['h']\n            nodos = prep['ns_de'][i]\n            pts_xy = [(tr['ax'], tr['ay'])] + [(h[0], h[1]) for h in hs] \\\n                + [(tr['bx'], tr['by'])]\n            z_t = [tr['az_t']] + [h[2] for h in hs] + [tr['bz_t']]\n            z_f = []\n            hz = []\n            hdz = []\n            wh = False\n            for q, idx in enumerate(nodos):\n                mov = zk[idx] != tk[idx]\n                zq = round(prep['z_ref'] + zk[idx] * GRID, 2) if mov \\\n                    else z_t[q]\n                z_f.append(zq)\n                if 0 < q < len(nodos) - 1:\n                    hz.append(zq)\n                    d = (zq - z_t[q]) if mov else 0.0\n                    hdz.append(d)\n                    if mov:\n                        wh = True\n                        stats['hincas_movidas'] += 1\n                        contab(d, tr['id'])\n                        if d < 0:\n                            stats['h_desmonte'] += -d\n                        else:\n                            stats['h_terraplen'] += d\n                        if abs(d) <= rug_v + 1e-9:\n                            stats['h_absorbidos'] += 1\n            s_a = 0.0\n            s_d = 0.0\n            ko_a = 0\n            ko_d = 0\n            for q in range(len(pts_xy) - 1):\n                ds = math.hypot(pts_xy[q + 1][0] - pts_xy[q][0],\n                                pts_xy[q + 1][1] - pts_xy[q][1])\n                if ds < 0.05:\n                    ds = 0.05\n                pa = abs(z_t[q + 1] - z_t[q]) / ds\n                pd = abs(z_f[q + 1] - z_f[q]) / ds\n                if pa > s_a:\n                    s_a = pa\n                if pd > s_d:\n                    s_d = pd\n                if pa > p_h + 1e-9:\n                    ko_a += 1\n                if pd > p_h + 0.006 / ds + 1e-9:\n                    ko_d += 1\n            stats['flex'] += 1\n            stats['hincas'] += len(hs)\n            stats['vanos'] += len(pts_xy) - 1\n            stats['vanos_ko_antes'] += ko_a\n            stats['vanos_ko_despues'] += ko_d\n            # v21: pendiente de la mesa flexible = su CUERDA (1a-ultima\n            # hinca) contra la pendiente general; el peor vano se guarda\n            # aparte (s_vano_*). 'viol' = cuerda o algun vano fuera.\n            l_ch = tr['len'] if tr['len'] > 0.05 else 0.05\n            c_a = abs(z_t[-1] - z_t[0]) / l_ch\n            c_d = abs(z_f[-1] - z_f[0]) / l_ch\n            if c_a > prep['p_frac'] + 1e-9:\n                stats['cuerda_ko_antes'] += 1\n            if c_d > prep['p_frac'] + 0.006 / l_ch + 1e-9:\n                stats['cuerda_ko_despues'] += 1\n            s_vano_a = s_a\n            s_vano_d = s_d\n            # v22: deflexiones (quiebros) antes y despues; motora excluida\n            # de las alas por convencion de fabricante\n            _pts2, _ds2, _zt2, _m2 = _geom_flex(prep, i)\n            d_h2 = DEFLEX_CFG['d_h']\n            d_ala2 = DEFLEX_CFG['d_ala']\n            qa, aa_a, ab_a, koq_a, koal_a = _deflex_tracker(\n                z_t, _ds2, _m2, d_h2, d_ala2)\n            qd, aa_d, ab_d, koq_d, koal_d = _deflex_tracker(\n                z_f, _ds2, _m2, d_h2, d_ala2)\n            stats['q_ko_a'] += koq_a\n            stats['q_ko_d'] += koq_d\n            stats['ala_ko_a'] += koal_a\n            stats['ala_ko_d'] += koal_d\n            if qa > stats['qmax_a']:\n                stats['qmax_a'] = qa\n            if qd > stats['qmax_d']:\n                stats['qmax_d'] = qd\n            if max(aa_a, ab_a) > stats['alamax_a']:\n                stats['alamax_a'] = max(aa_a, ab_a)\n            if max(aa_d, ab_d) > stats['alamax_d']:\n                stats['alamax_d'] = max(aa_d, ab_d)\n            s_antes = c_a\n            s_desp = c_d\n            viol = (ko_a > 0) or (c_a > prep['p_frac'] + 1e-9) \\\n                or (koq_a > 0) or (koal_a > 0)\n            tocado = wa or wb or wh\n        else:\n            hz = None\n            hdz = None\n            s_antes = abs(tr['az_t'] - tr['bz_t']) / tr['len']\n            s_desp = abs(za - zb) / tr['len']\n            viol = s_antes > prep['p_frac'] + 1e-9\n            tocado = wa or wb\n        if viol:\n            stats['violaban'] += 1\n        if tocado:\n            if viol:\n                clase = 'CORRIGE'\n                stats['corregidos'] += 1\n            else:\n                tocado_long = True\n                if zk_long is not None:\n                    tocado_long = any(zk_long[j] != tk[j]\n                                      for j in prep['ns_de'][i]) \\\n                        if es_flex else (zk_long[ia] != tk[ia]\n                                         or zk_long[ib] != tk[ib])\n                if tocado_long:\n                    clase = 'ARRASTRE'\n                    stats['arrastrados'] += 1\n                else:\n                    clase = 'EO'\n                    stats['ajuste_eo'] += 1\n        else:\n            clase = 'OK'\n            stats['sin_tocar'] += 1\n        for dz in (dza, dzb):\n            contab(dz, tr['id'])\n        if s_antes > stats['s_max_antes']:\n            stats['s_max_antes'] = s_antes\n        if s_desp > stats['s_max_despues']:\n            stats['s_max_despues'] = s_desp\n        item = {'za': za, 'zb': zb, 'wa': wa, 'wb': wb, 'clase': clase,\n                's_antes': s_antes, 's_despues': s_desp,\n                'dza': dza, 'dzb': dzb}\n        if es_flex:\n            item['flex'] = True\n            item['hz'] = hz\n            item['hdz'] = hdz\n            item['s_vano_antes'] = s_vano_a\n            item['s_vano_despues'] = s_vano_d\n            item['quiebro_max'] = qd\n            item['alas'] = (aa_d, ab_d)\n            item['motora'] = _m2\n        res.append(item)\n    last = len(tk) - 1\n    a_mov = round((zk[0] - tk[0]) * GRID, 2) if zk[0] != tk[0] else None\n    b_mov = round((zk[last] - tk[last]) * GRID, 2) \\\n        if zk[last] != tk[last] else None\n    return {'status': 'OK', 'msg': '', 'res': res,\n            'anc': {'a_mov': a_mov, 'b_mov': b_mov}, 'stats': stats}\n\n\ndef edges_lim(prep, i_tracker):\n    \"\"\"Limite longitudinal (m) de la cuerda i (w de su arista 'T').\"\"\"\n    cnt = -1\n    for (tipo, w) in prep['edges']:\n        if tipo == 'T':\n            cnt += 1\n            if cnt == i_tracker:\n                return w * GRID\n    return 0.0\n\n\ndef procesar_eje(trs, p_frac, escalon_m, gap_cont_m, tol_ext_m,\n                 w_fill=3, w_anc=10, rug_m=0.0, w_cut=1, p_hincas=None):\n    \"\"\"Wrapper compatible v01: preparar + resolver + clasificar.\"\"\"\n    prep = preparar_eje(trs, p_frac, escalon_m, gap_cont_m, tol_ext_m,\n                        w_fill, w_anc, rug_m, 1, p_hincas)\n    if prep['status'] == 'KO':\n        return {'status': 'KO', 'msg': prep['msg'], 'res': [],\n                'anc': {'a_mov': None, 'b_mov': None},\n                'stats': prep.get('stats', {})}\n    zk = resolver_eje(prep)\n    if zk is None:\n        return {'status': 'KO',\n                'msg': 'subcadena infactible (inesperado)', 'res': [],\n                'anc': {'a_mov': None, 'b_mov': None}, 'stats': {}}\n    return clasificar_eje(prep, zk)\n\n\n# =============================================================================\n# FASE EO: emparejado, cajas, barridos y verificacion (v02)\n# =============================================================================\ndef _geo_tracker(tr, modo):\n    \"\"\"(s_a, s_b, c_mid): coordenada 'a lo largo' de A y B y 'transversal'\n    media del tracker.\"\"\"\n    if modo == 'NS':\n        return tr['ay'], tr['by'], 0.5 * (tr['ax'] + tr['bx'])\n    return tr['ax'], tr['bx'], 0.5 * (tr['ay'] + tr['by'])\n\n\ndef _est_nodos(prep, t, modo):\n    \"\"\"Estaciones (a lo largo del eje) de TODOS los nodos del tracker t:\n    [sA, s_h1, ..., sB] en el orden de la cadena.\"\"\"\n    tr = prep['trs'][t]\n    sa, sb, _ = _geo_tracker(tr, modo)\n    hs = tr.get('h') or []\n    if not hs:\n        return [sa, sb]\n    if modo == 'NS':\n        est = [sa] + [h[1] for h in hs] + [sb]\n    else:\n        est = [sa] + [h[0] for h in hs] + [sb]\n    return est\n\n\ndef perfil_z(prep, zk, t, s, modo):\n    \"\"\"Cota del perfil REAL de la mesa t en la estacion s: polilinea por\n    todos sus nodos (con hincas); con trackers fijos es la cuerda A-B.\"\"\"\n    nodos = prep['ns_de'][t] if prep.get('ns_de') else [2 * t, 2 * t + 1]\n    est = _est_nodos(prep, t, modo)\n    zs = [z_eff(prep, zk, j) for j in nodos]\n    if len(est) == 2:\n        return _interp_z(est[0], zs[0], est[1], zs[1], s)\n    # orden creciente de estacion (A puede ser la mayor en NS)\n    pares_es = sorted(zip(est, zs))\n    e0, z0 = pares_es[0]\n    if s <= e0:\n        return z0\n    for k in range(1, len(pares_es)):\n        e1, z1 = pares_es[k]\n        if s <= e1 + 1e-9:\n            return _interp_z(e0, z0, e1, z1, s)\n        e0, z0 = e1, z1\n    return z0\n\n\ndef _interp_z(sa, za, sb, zb, s):\n    if abs(sb - sa) < 1e-9:\n        return 0.5 * (za + zb)\n    lam = (s - sa) / (sb - sa)\n    if lam < 0.0:\n        lam = 0.0\n    if lam > 1.0:\n        lam = 1.0\n    return za + (zb - za) * lam\n\n\ndef emparejar_pares(preps, modo, pitch, margen, solape_min):\n    \"\"\"Pares de mesas entre ejes vecinos: distancia transversal entre ejes\n    dentro de [pitch-margen, pitch+margen] y solape a lo largo >= solape_min.\n    Devuelve lista de dicts.\"\"\"\n    coords = []\n    for e, prep in enumerate(preps):\n        if prep['status'] != 'OK':\n            coords.append(None)\n            continue\n        cs = [_geo_tracker(tr, modo)[2] for tr in prep['trs']]\n        coords.append(sum(cs) / len(cs))\n    orden = sorted([e for e in range(len(preps)) if coords[e] is not None],\n                   key=lambda e: coords[e])\n    lo_w = pitch - margen\n    hi_w = pitch + margen\n    pares = []\n    for ii, ea in enumerate(orden):\n        for jj in range(ii + 1, len(orden)):\n            eb = orden[jj]\n            dax = coords[eb] - coords[ea]\n            if dax > hi_w:\n                break\n            if dax < lo_w:\n                continue\n            for ta, tra in enumerate(preps[ea]['trs']):\n                sa1, sb1, c1 = _geo_tracker(tra, modo)\n                lo1, hi1 = min(sa1, sb1), max(sa1, sb1)\n                for tb, trb in enumerate(preps[eb]['trs']):\n                    sa2, sb2, c2 = _geo_tracker(trb, modo)\n                    lo2, hi2 = min(sa2, sb2), max(sa2, sb2)\n                    s_lo = max(lo1, lo2)\n                    s_hi = min(hi1, hi2)\n                    d = abs(c2 - c1)\n                    if d < 1e-6:\n                        continue\n                    if s_hi - s_lo >= solape_min:\n                        pares.append({'ea': ea, 'ta': ta, 'eb': eb,\n                                      'tb': tb, 'd': d, 's_lo': s_lo,\n                                      's_hi': s_hi})\n                        continue\n                    # PARES EN PUNTA (escalones/diagonales): extremos\n                    # enfrentados de mesas sin solape suficiente. Limite\n                    # sobre la DIAGONAL real en planta (max 15 m, como el\n                    # lado de triangulo del analisis de pendientes).\n                    mejor = None\n                    for u in (sa1, sb1):\n                        for v in (sa2, sb2):\n                            ds = u - v if u >= v else v - u\n                            if mejor is None or ds < mejor[0]:\n                                mejor = (ds, u, v)\n                    ds, u, v = mejor\n                    d_pl = (d * d + ds * ds) ** 0.5\n                    if d_pl > 15.0:\n                        continue\n                    pares.append({'ea': ea, 'ta': ta, 'eb': eb, 'tb': tb,\n                                  'd': d_pl, 's_lo': u if u < v else v,\n                                  's_hi': v if u < v else u,\n                                  'punta': True})\n    return pares\n\n\nPASO_EO = 0.10    # region de confianza: movimiento max por nodo y pasada (m)\nMOV_EO_MAX = 1.00  # tope BASE de movimiento EO respecto al terreno (m)\nMOV_DIN = [MOV_EO_MAX]   # tope EO dinamico (se ajusta al TOL)\n_MOV_EFF = MOV_DIN[0]  # techo efectivo (dinamico por pasada)\n\n\ndef _cajas_para_eje(e, preps, zks, pares_eje, p_trans, paso=PASO_EO,\n                    descartes=None, z_base=None, paso_up=None):\n    \"\"\"Cajas por nodo del eje e contra el estado ACTUAL de sus vecinas.\n    (a) Mis extremos dentro del solape: caja directa contra la cuerda vecina\n        interpolada en su posicion.\n    (b) Extremos del solape que NO coinciden con extremos mios (tipicamente\n        el ancla de la mesa vecina cayendo en el interior de mi cuerda):\n        se acota mi extremo despejando la interpolacion con el valor actual\n        del otro extremo. Amplificacion limitada: peso propio >= 0.25.\n    Estabilidad: si dos exigencias se cruzan, la caja pasa a ser el\n    intervalo PUENTE entre ambas (no un punto); y toda caja se recorta a la\n    region de confianza [z_actual +- PASO_EO] para acotar el movimiento por\n    pasada (la convergencia reparte los grandes ajustes entre pasadas).\"\"\"\n    import math\n    prep = preps[e]\n    fixed = prep['fixed']\n    raw = {}     # idx -> (lo, hi) en metros\n\n    def add_box(idx, lo, hi):\n        if idx in raw:\n            plo, phi = raw[idx]\n            if plo > lo:\n                lo = plo\n            if phi < hi:\n                hi = phi\n            if lo > hi:\n                lo, hi = hi, lo          # puente entre exigencias cruzadas\n        raw[idx] = (lo, hi)\n\n    for par in pares_eje:\n        pi = par.get('pi', -1)\n        d0 = descartes is not None and (pi, 0) in descartes\n        d1 = descartes is not None and (pi, 1) in descartes\n        if d0 and d1:\n            continue\n        if par['ea'] == e:\n            t_mio, e_vec, t_vec = par['ta'], par['eb'], par['tb']\n        else:\n            t_mio, e_vec, t_vec = par['tb'], par['ea'], par['ta']\n        pv = preps[e_vec]\n        zv = zks[e_vec]\n        if zv is None:\n            continue\n        trv = pv['trs'][t_vec]\n        sav, sbv, _ = _geo_tracker(trv, par['modo'])\n        zav = z_ext(pv, zv, 2 * t_vec)\n        zbv = z_ext(pv, zv, 2 * t_vec + 1)\n        lim = p_trans * par['d']\n        trm = prep['trs'][t_mio]\n        sam, sbm, _ = _geo_tracker(trm, par['modo'])\n        ia, ib = EXT(prep, 2 * t_mio), EXT(prep, 2 * t_mio + 1)\n        # cajas directas: TODOS mis nodos del tracker (A, hincas, B) cuya\n        # estacion cae en el solape, contra el perfil REAL de la vecina\n        mis_nodos = prep['ns_de'][t_mio] if prep.get('ns_de') else [ia, ib]\n        mis_est = _est_nodos(prep, t_mio, par['modo'])\n        for idx, s_n in zip(mis_nodos, mis_est):\n            if s_n < par['s_lo'] - 1e-9 or s_n > par['s_hi'] + 1e-9:\n                continue\n            if idx in fixed:\n                continue\n            en_lo = abs(s_n - par['s_lo']) < 1e-6\n            en_hi = abs(s_n - par['s_hi']) < 1e-6\n            if (en_lo and d0) or (en_hi and d1) \\\n                    or (not en_lo and not en_hi and d0 and d1):\n                continue\n            zj = perfil_z(pv, zv, t_vec, s_n, par['modo'])\n            add_box(idx, zj - lim, zj + lim)\n\n        den = sbm - sam\n        if abs(den) < 1e-9:\n            continue\n        za_cur = z_eff(prep, zks[e], ia)\n        zb_cur = z_eff(prep, zks[e], ib)\n        anc = prep['anc_box']\n        a_anc = ia in anc\n        b_anc = ib in anc\n        lo_m = sam if sam < sbm else sbm\n        hi_m = sbm if sam < sbm else sam\n        for i_end, s_star in enumerate((par['s_lo'], par['s_hi'])):\n            if (i_end == 0 and d0) or (i_end == 1 and d1):\n                continue\n            if s_star < lo_m - 1e-6 or s_star > hi_m + 1e-6:\n                continue          # estacion fuera de mi cuerda: no extrapolar\n            if abs(s_star - sam) < 1e-6 or abs(s_star - sbm) < 1e-6:\n                continue\n            wb = (s_star - sam) / den\n            wa = 1.0 - wb\n            zj = perfil_z(pv, zv, t_vec, s_star, par['modo'])\n            lo, hi = zj - lim, zj + lim\n            cand = []\n            if wa >= 0.25:\n                cand.append((a_anc, -wa, ia, wa, wb, zb_cur))\n            if wb >= 0.25:\n                cand.append((b_anc, -wb, ib, wb, wa, za_cur))\n            if not cand:\n                continue\n            cand.sort()   # primero no-ancla; a igualdad, mayor peso propio\n            _, _, sel, w_self, w_other, otro = cand[0]\n            add_box(sel, (lo - w_other * otro) / w_self,\n                    (hi - w_other * otro) / w_self)\n\n    boxes = {}\n    for idx, (lo, hi) in raw.items():\n        zc = z_eff(prep, zks[e], idx)\n        t_i = z_base[idx] if z_base is not None else prep['t_ex'][idx]\n        tlo = zc - paso\n        thi = zc + (paso if paso_up is None else paso_up)\n        if t_i - _MOV_EFF > tlo:\n            tlo = t_i - _MOV_EFF\n        if t_i + _MOV_EFF < thi:\n            thi = t_i + _MOV_EFF\n        if tlo > thi:\n            tlo = thi = 0.5 * (tlo + thi)\n        if lo > thi:                     # exigencia entera por encima\n            lo = hi = thi\n        elif hi < tlo:                   # exigencia entera por debajo\n            lo = hi = tlo\n        else:\n            if lo < tlo:\n                lo = tlo\n            if hi > thi:\n                hi = thi\n        lo_k = int(math.ceil((lo - prep['z_ref']) / GRID - 1e-9))\n        hi_k = int(math.floor((hi - prep['z_ref']) / GRID + 1e-9))\n        if lo_k > hi_k:                  # caja mas fina que una celda\n            lo_k = hi_k = _round_half_up(\n                (0.5 * (lo + hi) - prep['z_ref']) / GRID)\n        boxes[idx] = (lo_k, hi_k)\n    return boxes\n\n\ndef _dp_offsets(caps, pesos, aristas):\n    \"\"\"DP exacta sobre desplazamientos UNIFORMES por columna (en pasos).\n    caps[i]   : (lo, hi) tope de delta_i.\n    pesos[i]  : (c_dn, c_up) coste por paso (desmonte/terraplen).\n    aristas[i]: (LO, HI) restriccion delta_i - delta_{i+1} in [LO, HI],\n                o None si no hay enlace (subcadenas independientes).\n    Devuelve lista de deltas optima o None si infactible.\"\"\"\n    n = len(caps)\n    kmin = min(lo for lo, hi in caps) - 1\n    kmax = max(hi for lo, hi in caps) + 1\n    S = kmax - kmin + 1\n    if S <= 1 or S > 4000:\n        return None\n\n    def ncost(i, base):\n        lo, hi = caps[i]\n        wd, wu = pesos[i]\n        out = [INF_I] * S\n        for k in range(lo - kmin, hi - kmin + 1):\n            if k < 0 or k > S - 1:\n                continue\n            b = base[k]\n            if b >= INF_I:\n                continue\n            d = k + kmin\n            out[k] = b + (wu * d if d > 0 else wd * (-d))\n        return out\n\n    F = [ncost(0, [0] * S)]\n    padres = [None]\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        ar = aristas[i - 1]\n        prev = F[-1]\n        base = [INF_I] * S\n        pad = [-1] * S\n        if ar is None:\n            bb = INF_I\n            kb = -1\n            for u in range(S):\n                if prev[u] < bb:\n                    bb = prev[u]\n                    kb = u\n            for k in range(S):\n                base[k] = bb\n                pad[k] = kb\n        else:\n            LO, HI = ar\n            for k in range(S):\n                d = k + kmin\n                u0 = d + LO - kmin\n                u1 = d + HI - kmin\n                if u0 < 0:\n                    u0 = 0\n                if u1 > S - 1:\n                    u1 = S - 1\n                bb = INF_I\n                kb = -1\n                for u in range(u0, u1 + 1):\n                    if prev[u] < bb:\n                        bb = prev[u]\n                        kb = u\n                base[k] = bb\n                pad[k] = kb\n        F.append(ncost(i, base))\n        padres.append(pad)\n    last = F[-1]\n    best = INF_I\n    kb = -1\n    for k in range(S):\n        if last[k] < best:\n            best = last[k]\n            kb = k\n    if best >= INF_I:\n        return None\n    sol = [0] * n\n    sol[n - 1] = kb\n    for i in range(n - 1, 0, -1):\n        sol[i - 1] = padres[i][sol[i]]\n    return [k + kmin for k in sol]\n\n\ndef _cascada_arrastre(preps, zks, pares, p_trans, bases, w_fill,\n                      dry_extra=None):\n    \"\"\"Forzado con arrastre: desplaza columnas ENTERAS (preserva pendientes\n    longitudinales y juntas) para que los pares KO cumplan, propagando el\n    movimiento por las vecinas dentro de SUS limites y topes de ancla.\n    Devuelve (columnas_movidas, delta_max_m).\"\"\"\n    if isinstance(w_fill, tuple):\n        w_c, w_f = w_fill\n    else:\n        w_c, w_f = 1, w_fill\n    kos = verificar_pares(preps, zks, pares, p_trans)\n    if not kos:\n        return 0, 0.0\n    modo = pares[0]['modo']\n    ady = {}\n    for par in pares:\n        ady.setdefault(par['ea'], set()).add(par['eb'])\n        ady.setdefault(par['eb'], set()).add(par['ea'])\n    ko_ejes = set()\n    for k in kos:\n        ko_ejes.add(k['ea'])\n        ko_ejes.add(k['eb'])\n    coord = {}\n    for e in ady:\n        cs = [_geo_tracker(tr, modo)[2] for tr in preps[e]['trs']]\n        coord[e] = sum(cs) / len(cs)\n    MOVK = int((_MOV_EFF + 1e-9) / GRID)\n    extra_k = 0 if dry_extra is None else int((dry_extra + 1e-9) / GRID)\n    comps_ok = 0\n    comps_tot = 0\n    vistos = set()\n    movidas = 0\n    dmax = 0\n    for e0 in sorted(ko_ejes):\n        if e0 in vistos:\n            continue\n        comp = []\n        pila = [e0]\n        vistos.add(e0)\n        while pila:\n            x = pila.pop()\n            comp.append(x)\n            for v in ady.get(x, ()):\n                if v not in vistos:\n                    vistos.add(v)\n                    pila.append(v)\n        comp.sort(key=lambda e: coord[e])\n        idx_de = {e: i for i, e in enumerate(comp)}\n        n = len(comp)\n        if n < 2:\n            continue\n        aristas = [None] * (n - 1)\n        for par in pares:\n            a, b2 = par['ea'], par['eb']\n            if a not in idx_de or b2 not in idx_de:\n                continue\n            ia, ib = idx_de[a], idx_de[b2]\n            if abs(ia - ib) != 1:\n                continue\n            if ia < ib:\n                w_, e_, tw, te = a, b2, par['ta'], par['tb']\n                k_ar = ia\n            else:\n                w_, e_, tw, te = b2, a, par['tb'], par['ta']\n                k_ar = ib\n            pw, pe = preps[w_], preps[e_]\n            trw = pw['trs'][tw]\n            tre = pe['trs'][te]\n            swa, swb, _ = _geo_tracker(trw, modo)\n            sea, seb, _ = _geo_tracker(tre, modo)\n            zwa = z_ext(pw, zks[w_], 2 * tw)\n            zwb = z_ext(pw, zks[w_], 2 * tw + 1)\n            zea = z_ext(pe, zks[e_], 2 * te)\n            zeb = z_ext(pe, zks[e_], 2 * te + 1)\n            lim_hold = int((p_trans * par['d'] + 0.010) / GRID)\n            lim_fix = int((p_trans * par['d'] + 0.002) / GRID)\n            if lim_fix < 1:\n                lim_fix = 1\n            for s in (par['s_lo'], par['s_hi']):\n                zi = _interp_z(swa, zwa, swb, zwb, s)\n                zj = _interp_z(sea, zea, seb, zeb, s)\n                gk = _round_half_up((zi - zj) / GRID)\n                limk = lim_fix if (gk > lim_hold or -gk > lim_hold) \\\n                    else lim_hold\n                lo = -limk - gk\n                hi = limk - gk\n                if aristas[k_ar] is None:\n                    aristas[k_ar] = (lo, hi)\n                else:\n                    plo, phi = aristas[k_ar]\n                    aristas[k_ar] = (max(plo, lo), min(phi, hi))\n        caps = []\n        pesos_c = []\n        for e in comp:\n            prep = preps[e]\n            zk = zks[e]\n            base = bases.get(e)\n            lo_c, hi_c = -160, 160\n            for idx in range(len(zk)):\n                if idx in prep['anc_box']:\n                    alo, ahi = prep['anc_box'][idx]\n                    lo_c = max(lo_c, alo - extra_k - zk[idx])\n                    hi_c = min(hi_c, ahi + extra_k - zk[idx])\n                if base is not None:\n                    bk = _round_half_up((base[idx] - prep['z_ref']) / GRID)\n                    lo_c = max(lo_c, bk - MOVK - zk[idx])\n                    hi_c = min(hi_c, bk + MOVK - zk[idx])\n            if lo_c > 0:\n                lo_c = 0\n            if hi_c < 0:\n                hi_c = 0\n            caps.append((lo_c, hi_c))\n            nn = len(zk)\n            pesos_c.append((nn * w_c, nn * w_f))\n        for i in range(n - 1):\n            if aristas[i] is not None:\n                lo, hi = aristas[i]\n                if lo > hi:\n                    aristas[i] = (hi, lo)\n        sol = _dp_offsets(caps, pesos_c, aristas)\n        if dry_extra is not None:\n            comps_tot += 1\n            if sol is not None:\n                comps_ok += 1\n            continue\n        eps = 1\n        while sol is None and eps <= 4096:\n            ar2 = [None if a is None else (a[0] - eps, a[1] + eps)\n                   for a in aristas]\n            sol = _dp_offsets(caps, pesos_c, ar2)\n            eps *= 2\n        if sol is None:\n            continue\n        for i, e in enumerate(comp):\n            d = sol[i]\n            if d:\n                zks[e] = [k + d for k in zks[e]]\n                movidas += 1\n                if abs(d) > dmax:\n                    dmax = abs(d)\n    if dry_extra is not None:\n        return comps_ok, comps_tot\n    return movidas, dmax * GRID\n\n\n\ndef _peine_eo(preps, zks, pares, p_trans, bases, w_fill,\n              max_filas=12, max_exp=4, n_win=12):\n    \"\"\"v18 PEINE EO: rescate por FILAS de mesas (el movimiento que el\n    Gauss-Seidel por columnas no coordina). Para cada par KO toma la fila\n    de mesas que cruza su estacion (una mesa por columna, W->E, ventana\n    de n_win columnas a cada lado del par) y la resuelve con la DP exacta\n    (_dp_offsets) con UN delta por MESA:\n      aristas = pares EO entre mesas seleccionadas de columnas vecinas\n                (ambos extremos del solape, misma cuantizacion que la\n                cascada);\n      topes   = anclas de los nodos de la mesa + techo MOV vs base +\n                margen de junta/escalon con las vecinas N-S no\n                seleccionadas + pares EO con mesas no seleccionadas.\n    Si el DP no resuelve, amplia el grupo una mesa por junta a cada lado\n    (la cuna se degrada por los escalones) y reintenta; el ultimo intento\n    ademas triplica la ventana de columnas. Solo ACEPTA un resultado si\n    la verificacion GLOBAL mejora estrictamente (n KOs, exceso total):\n    cualquier aproximacion del modelo queda vetada por la verificacion,\n    de modo que el peine NUNCA puede empeorar el estado.\"\"\"\n    if isinstance(w_fill, tuple):\n        w_c, w_f = w_fill\n    else:\n        w_c, w_f = 1, w_fill\n    info = {'filas': 0, 'aplicadas': 0, 'mesas_movidas': 0, 'dmax': 0.0,\n            'ampliaciones': 0, 'infactibles': 0, 'kos_ini': 0,\n            'kos_fin': 0}\n    kos0 = verificar_pares(preps, zks, pares, p_trans)\n    info['kos_ini'] = len(kos0)\n    if not kos0 or not pares:\n        info['kos_fin'] = len(kos0)\n        return info\n    modo = pares[0]['modo']\n    MOVK = int((_MOV_EFF + 1e-9) / GRID)\n\n    ady = {}\n    pares_de = {}\n    for par in pares:\n        ady.setdefault(par['ea'], set()).add(par['eb'])\n        ady.setdefault(par['eb'], set()).add(par['ea'])\n        pares_de.setdefault(par['ea'], []).append(par)\n        pares_de.setdefault(par['eb'], []).append(par)\n    coord = {}\n    for e in ady:\n        if preps[e]['status'] != 'OK' or zks[e] is None:\n            continue\n        cs = [_geo_tracker(t, modo)[2] for t in preps[e]['trs']]\n        coord[e] = sum(cs) / len(cs)\n\n    def cuerda(e, t, s):\n        prep = preps[e]\n        tr = prep['trs'][t]\n        sa, sb, _ = _geo_tracker(tr, modo)\n        return _interp_z(sa, z_ext(prep, zks[e], 2 * t),\n                         sb, z_ext(prep, zks[e], 2 * t + 1), s)\n\n    def lims_par(par):\n        lim_hold = int((p_trans * par['d'] + 0.010) / GRID)\n        lim_fix = int((p_trans * par['d'] + 0.002) / GRID)\n        if lim_fix < 1:\n            lim_fix = 1\n        return lim_hold, lim_fix\n\n    def mesa_en(e, s):\n        best = None\n        for t in range(preps[e]['n']):\n            sa, sb, _ = _geo_tracker(preps[e]['trs'][t], modo)\n            lo, hi = (sa, sb) if sa <= sb else (sb, sa)\n            if lo - 1e-9 <= s <= hi + 1e-9:\n                d = 0.0\n            elif s < lo:\n                d = lo - s\n            else:\n                d = s - hi\n            if best is None or d < best[0]:\n                best = (d, t)\n        if best is None or best[0] > 15.0:\n            return None\n        return best[1]\n\n    def grupo(e, t0, radio):\n        edges = preps[e]['edges']\n        lo = hi = t0\n        for _ in range(radio):\n            if lo > 0 and edges[preps[e]['jidx'][lo - 1]][0] == 'J':\n                lo -= 1\n            if hi < preps[e]['n'] - 1 and edges[preps[e]['jidx'][hi]][0] == 'J':\n                hi += 1\n        return list(range(lo, hi + 1))\n\n    def score():\n        ks = verificar_pares(preps, zks, pares, p_trans)\n        exc = 0.0\n        for k in ks:\n            exc += k['exceso']\n        return (len(ks), round(exc, 3))\n\n    def resolver_fila(chain, grupos):\n        idx_de = {e2: i for i, e2 in enumerate(chain)}\n        caps = []\n        pesos_c = []\n        for e2 in chain:\n            prep = preps[e2]\n            zk = zks[e2]\n            G = grupos[e2]\n            lo_c, hi_c = -MOVK, MOVK\n            fijo = False\n            base = bases.get(e2)\n            for t in G:\n                for idx in prep['ns_de'][t]:\n                    if idx in prep['fixed']:\n                        fijo = True\n                    if idx in prep['anc_box']:\n                        alo, ahi = prep['anc_box'][idx]\n                        l2 = alo - zk[idx]\n                        h2 = ahi - zk[idx]\n                        if l2 > lo_c:\n                            lo_c = l2\n                        if h2 < hi_c:\n                            hi_c = h2\n                    if base is not None:\n                        bk = _round_half_up((base[idx] - prep['z_ref'])\n                                            / GRID)\n                        l2 = bk - MOVK - zk[idx]\n                        h2 = bk + MOVK - zk[idx]\n                        if l2 > lo_c:\n                            lo_c = l2\n                        if h2 < hi_c:\n                            hi_c = h2\n            edges = prep['edges']\n            t_lo, t_hi = G[0], G[-1]\n            if t_lo > 0 and edges[prep['jidx'][t_lo - 1]][0] == 'J':\n                w = edges[prep['jidx'][t_lo - 1]][1]\n                g = zk[EXT(prep, 2 * t_lo)] - zk[EXT(prep, 2 * t_lo - 1)]\n                if -w - g > lo_c:\n                    lo_c = -w - g\n                if w - g < hi_c:\n                    hi_c = w - g\n            if t_hi < prep['n'] - 1 and edges[prep['jidx'][t_hi]][0] == 'J':\n                w = edges[prep['jidx'][t_hi]][1]\n                g = zk[EXT(prep, 2 * t_hi + 1)] - zk[EXT(prep, 2 * t_hi + 2)]\n                if -w - g > lo_c:\n                    lo_c = -w - g\n                if w - g < hi_c:\n                    hi_c = w - g\n            for par in pares_de.get(e2, ()):\n                if par['ea'] == e2:\n                    t_m, e_o, t_o = par['ta'], par['eb'], par['tb']\n                else:\n                    t_m, e_o, t_o = par['tb'], par['ea'], par['ta']\n                if t_m not in G:\n                    continue\n                if e_o in idx_de and t_o in grupos.get(e_o, ()):\n                    continue                          # va a aristas\n                if zks[e_o] is None:\n                    continue\n                lim_hold, lim_fix = lims_par(par)\n                for s2 in (par['s_lo'], par['s_hi']):\n                    zm = cuerda(e2, t_m, s2)\n                    zo = cuerda(e_o, t_o, s2)\n                    gk = _round_half_up((zm - zo) / GRID)\n                    limk = lim_fix if (gk > lim_hold or -gk > lim_hold) \\\n                        else lim_hold\n                    if -limk - gk > lo_c:\n                        lo_c = -limk - gk\n                    if limk - gk < hi_c:\n                        hi_c = limk - gk\n            if fijo:\n                lo_c = hi_c = 0\n            if lo_c > 0:\n                lo_c = 0\n            if hi_c < 0:\n                hi_c = 0\n            caps.append((int(lo_c), int(hi_c)))\n            nn = sum(len(prep['ns_de'][t]) for t in G)\n            pesos_c.append((nn * w_c, nn * w_f))\n        aristas = [None] * (len(chain) - 1)\n        for par in pares:\n            a, b2 = par['ea'], par['eb']\n            if a not in idx_de or b2 not in idx_de:\n                continue\n            if par['ta'] not in grupos[a] or par['tb'] not in grupos[b2]:\n                continue\n            ia, ib = idx_de[a], idx_de[b2]\n            if abs(ia - ib) != 1:\n                continue      # no modelable en cadena: si molestara, lo\n                              # vetaria la verificacion global\n            if ia < ib:\n                e_w, t_w, e_e, t_e, k_ar = a, par['ta'], b2, par['tb'], ia\n            else:\n                e_w, t_w, e_e, t_e, k_ar = b2, par['tb'], a, par['ta'], ib\n            lim_hold, lim_fix = lims_par(par)\n            for s2 in (par['s_lo'], par['s_hi']):\n                zw = cuerda(e_w, t_w, s2)\n                ze = cuerda(e_e, t_e, s2)\n                gk = _round_half_up((zw - ze) / GRID)\n                limk = lim_fix if (gk > lim_hold or -gk > lim_hold) \\\n                    else lim_hold\n                lo2 = -limk - gk\n                hi2 = limk - gk\n                if aristas[k_ar] is None:\n                    aristas[k_ar] = (lo2, hi2)\n                else:\n                    plo, phi = aristas[k_ar]\n                    aristas[k_ar] = (plo if plo > lo2 else lo2,\n                                     phi if phi < hi2 else hi2)\n        for i in range(len(aristas)):\n            if aristas[i] is not None:\n                lo2, hi2 = aristas[i]\n                if lo2 > hi2:\n                    aristas[i] = (hi2, lo2)\n        return _dp_offsets(caps, pesos_c, aristas)\n\n    tratados = set()\n    for _fila in range(max_filas):\n        kos = verificar_pares(preps, zks, pares, p_trans)\n        if not kos:\n            break\n        kos.sort(key=lambda k: -k['exceso'])\n        ko = None\n        for k in kos:\n            if (k['pi'], k['end']) not in tratados:\n                ko = k\n                break\n        if ko is None:\n            break\n        tratados.add((ko['pi'], ko['end']))\n        info['filas'] += 1\n        par0 = pares[ko['pi']]\n        s_ko = ko['s']\n        comp = set()\n        pila = [ko['ea'], ko['eb']]\n        while pila:\n            x = pila.pop()\n            if x in comp or x not in coord:\n                continue\n            comp.add(x)\n            for v in ady.get(x, ()):\n                if v not in comp:\n                    pila.append(v)\n        if ko['ea'] not in comp or ko['eb'] not in comp:\n            continue\n        cols_all = sorted(comp, key=lambda e2: coord[e2])\n        pos = {e2: i for i, e2 in enumerate(cols_all)}\n        p_lo = pos[ko['ea']] if pos[ko['ea']] < pos[ko['eb']] \\\n            else pos[ko['eb']]\n        p_hi = pos[ko['ea']] if pos[ko['ea']] > pos[ko['eb']] \\\n            else pos[ko['eb']]\n        score_ini = score()\n        for radio in range(0, max_exp + 1):\n            if radio > 0:\n                info['ampliaciones'] += 1\n            win = n_win if radio < max_exp else 3 * n_win\n            cols = [e2 for e2 in cols_all\n                    if p_lo - win <= pos[e2] <= p_hi + win]\n            sel = {}\n            for e2 in cols:\n                t0 = mesa_en(e2, s_ko)\n                if t0 is not None:\n                    sel[e2] = t0\n            sel[ko['ea']] = par0['ta']\n            sel[ko['eb']] = par0['tb']\n            chain = [e2 for e2 in cols if e2 in sel]\n            if len(chain) < 2:\n                break\n            grupos = {e2: grupo(e2, sel[e2], radio) for e2 in chain}\n            sol = resolver_fila(chain, grupos)\n            if sol is None:\n                info['infactibles'] += 1\n                continue\n            if not any(sol):\n                continue\n            back = {}\n            for i, e2 in enumerate(chain):\n                d = sol[i]\n                if d:\n                    back[e2] = zks[e2]\n                    z2 = list(zks[e2])\n                    for t in grupos[e2]:\n                        for _q in preps[e2]['ns_de'][t]:\n                            z2[_q] += d\n                    zks[e2] = z2\n            if score() < score_ini:\n                info['aplicadas'] += 1\n                for i, e2 in enumerate(chain):\n                    if sol[i]:\n                        info['mesas_movidas'] += len(grupos[e2])\n                        dm = abs(sol[i]) * GRID\n                        if dm > info['dmax']:\n                            info['dmax'] = dm\n                break\n            for e2, z0 in back.items():\n                zks[e2] = z0\n    info['kos_fin'] = len(verificar_pares(preps, zks, pares, p_trans))\n    return info\n\n\ndef verificar_pares(preps, zks, pares, p_trans, holgura=0.011):\n    \"\"\"Comprueba cada par sobre cotas efectivas REALES en los dos extremos\n    del solape y, si alguna de las dos mesas es flexible, tambien en cada\n    estacion de hinca dentro del solape (perfil real por polilinea).\"\"\"\n    kos = []\n    for i_par, par in enumerate(pares):\n        pa, pb = preps[par['ea']], preps[par['eb']]\n        za_, zb_ = zks[par['ea']], zks[par['eb']]\n        if za_ is None or zb_ is None:\n            continue\n        tra = pa['trs'][par['ta']]\n        trb = pb['trs'][par['tb']]\n        modo = par['modo']\n        lim = p_trans * par['d']\n        ests = [(0, par['s_lo']), (1, par['s_hi'])]\n        fa = bool(pa.get('flex') and pa['flex'][par['ta']])\n        fb = bool(pb.get('flex') and pb['flex'][par['tb']])\n        if fa or fb:\n            extra = []\n            if fa:\n                extra += _est_nodos(pa, par['ta'], modo)[1:-1]\n            if fb:\n                extra += _est_nodos(pb, par['tb'], modo)[1:-1]\n            for s_h in extra:\n                if par['s_lo'] + 1e-6 < s_h < par['s_hi'] - 1e-6:\n                    ests.append((2, s_h))\n        for i_end, s in ests:\n            zi = perfil_z(pa, za_, par['ta'], s, modo)\n            zj = perfil_z(pb, zb_, par['tb'], s, modo)\n            exceso = abs(zi - zj) - lim - holgura\n            if exceso > 1e-9:\n                kos.append({'ea': par['ea'], 'ida': tra['id'],\n                            'eb': par['eb'], 'idb': trb['id'], 's': s,\n                            'dz': abs(zi - zj), 'lim': lim,\n                            'exceso': exceso, 'pi': i_par, 'end': i_end})\n    return kos\n\n\ndef procesar_planta(ejes_trs, modo, p_long, p_trans, escalon_m, gap_cont_m,\n                    tol_ext_m, pitch, margen, solape_min, fase,\n                    max_pasadas, w_fill=3, w_anc=10, rug_m=0.0,\n                    tol_rescate=0.0, w_cut=1,\n                    p_hincas=None):\n    \"\"\"Pipeline completo: fase LONG exacta por eje + fase EO por barridos.\n    Devuelve {'ejes': [dict formato v01 por eje], 'eo': {...}}.\"\"\"\n    global _MOV_EFF\n    _MOV_EFF = MOV_DIN[0]\n    for t_v in (tol_ext_m, tol_rescate):\n        if t_v + 0.2 > _MOV_EFF:\n            _MOV_EFF = t_v + 0.2\n    eff_tol = tol_rescate if tol_rescate > tol_ext_m else tol_ext_m\n    MOV_DIN[0] = (MOV_EO_MAX if eff_tol + 0.5 < MOV_EO_MAX\n                  else eff_tol + 0.5)\n    if p_hincas is None:\n        p_hincas = p_long\n\n    def _ph(p_esc):\n        # pendiente de hincas escalada en la misma proporcion que p_long\n        return p_hincas * (p_esc / p_long) if p_long > 0 else p_hincas\n    preps = []\n    for trs in ejes_trs:\n        prep = preparar_eje(trs, p_long, escalon_m, gap_cont_m,\n                        tol_ext_m, w_fill, w_anc, rug_m, w_cut,\n                        p_hincas)\n        if (prep['status'] == 'KO' and tol_rescate > tol_ext_m\n                and 'deficit_m' in prep.get('stats', {})):\n            # (a) anclas mas libres\n            p2 = preparar_eje(trs, p_long, escalon_m, gap_cont_m,\n                        tol_rescate, w_fill, w_anc, rug_m, w_cut,\n                        p_hincas)\n            if p2['status'] == 'OK':\n                p2['rescate'] = {'tipo': 'ANCLAS', 'tol': tol_rescate,\n                                 'p_eff': p_long}\n                prep = p2\n            else:\n                # (b) pendiente minima factible (busqueda binaria)\n                dz = abs(trs[0]['az_t'] - trs[-1]['bz_t'])\n                sl = sum(t['len'] for t in trs)\n                hi = dz / sl + 0.01 if sl > 0 else p_long\n                p3 = preparar_eje(trs, hi, escalon_m, gap_cont_m,\n                        tol_rescate, w_fill, w_anc, rug_m, w_cut,\n                        _ph(hi))\n                intentos = 0\n                while p3['status'] != 'OK' and intentos < 6:\n                    hi *= 2.0\n                    p3 = preparar_eje(trs, hi, escalon_m, gap_cont_m,\n                        tol_rescate, w_fill, w_anc, rug_m, w_cut,\n                        _ph(hi))\n                    intentos += 1\n                if p3['status'] == 'OK':\n                    lo = p_long\n                    mejor_p = p3\n                    p_ok = hi\n                    for _ in range(40):\n                        mid = 0.5 * (lo + hi)\n                        pm = preparar_eje(trs, mid, escalon_m, gap_cont_m,\n                        tol_rescate, w_fill, w_anc, rug_m, w_cut,\n                        _ph(mid))\n                        if pm['status'] == 'OK':\n                            hi = mid\n                            mejor_p = pm\n                            p_ok = mid\n                        else:\n                            lo = mid\n                    mejor_p['rescate'] = {'tipo': 'PENDIENTE',\n                                          'tol': tol_rescate, 'p_eff': p_ok}\n                    prep = mejor_p\n        preps.append(prep)\n    zks = []\n    for prep in preps:\n        zks.append(resolver_eje(prep) if prep['status'] == 'OK' else None)\n    zk_long = [list(z) if z is not None else None for z in zks]\n    w_fill = (w_cut, w_fill)   # par de pesos para la cascada\n\n    eo = {'activa': False, 'pares': 0, 'pasadas': 0, 'convergio': True,\n          'relajaciones': 0, 'col_sin_resolver': 0, 'ko_pares': [],\n          'nodos_movidos_eo': 0}\n    if fase == 'LONG+EO' and p_trans > 0:\n        eo['activa'] = True\n        pares = emparejar_pares(preps, modo, pitch, margen, solape_min)\n        for i_par, par in enumerate(pares):\n            par['modo'] = modo\n            par['pi'] = i_par\n        eo['pares'] = len(pares)\n        eo['pares_punta'] = sum(1 for p in pares if p.get('punta'))\n        pares_por_eje = {}\n        for par in pares:\n            pares_por_eje.setdefault(par['ea'], []).append(par)\n            pares_por_eje.setdefault(par['eb'], []).append(par)\n\n        coords = {}\n        for e, prep in enumerate(preps):\n            if prep['status'] == 'OK':\n                cs = [_geo_tracker(tr, modo)[2] for tr in prep['trs']]\n                coords[e] = sum(cs) / len(cs)\n        orden_base = sorted(coords.keys(), key=lambda e: coords[e])\n        # ---- v19: work-list de columnas sucias --------------------------\n        vecinos = {}\n        for par in pares:\n            vecinos.setdefault(par['ea'], set()).add(par['eb'])\n            vecinos.setdefault(par['eb'], set()).add(par['ea'])\n        sucias = set(pares_por_eje.keys())\n        eo['wl_resueltas'] = 0\n        eo['wl_potencial'] = 0\n        eo['peine_sw'] = None\n        bases = {}\n        for e in pares_por_eje:\n            if zk_long[e] is not None:\n                bases[e] = [z_eff(preps[e], zk_long[e], i)\n                            for i in range(len(zk_long[e]))]\n\n        convergio = False\n        mejor = None      # (score, snapshot zks, pasada)\n        descartes = set()\n        racha = {}\n        exc_prev = {}\n        firmas = []\n        solo_desmonte = True      # etapa 1: subir congelado (prioriza corte)\n        eo['pasadas_desmonte'] = 0\n        eo['arrastre_casc'] = 0\n        eo['arrastre_cols'] = 0\n        eo['arrastre_max'] = 0.0\n        cascadas = 0\n        peines_sw = 0\n\n        def _peine_sweep():\n            # v19: barrido de FILAS al estancarse, antes de rendirse.\n            # Reutiliza el peine (solo acepta si mejora la verificacion\n            # global) y devuelve True si aplico algo, para que la\n            # relajacion por columnas continue puliendo desde ahi.\n            nonlocal peines_sw, firmas, descartes, racha, exc_prev, \\\n                sucias, mejor\n            if peines_sw >= 3:\n                return False\n            if not verificar_pares(preps, zks, pares, p_trans):\n                return False\n            peines_sw += 1\n            pinfo = _peine_eo(preps, zks, pares, p_trans, bases, w_fill,\n                              max_filas=6)\n            ac = eo.get('peine_sw')\n            if ac is None:\n                eo['peine_sw'] = dict(pinfo)\n                eo['peine_sw']['barridos'] = 1\n            else:\n                for k_a in ('filas', 'aplicadas', 'mesas_movidas',\n                            'ampliaciones', 'infactibles'):\n                    ac[k_a] += pinfo[k_a]\n                if pinfo['dmax'] > ac['dmax']:\n                    ac['dmax'] = pinfo['dmax']\n                ac['kos_fin'] = pinfo['kos_fin']\n                ac['barridos'] += 1\n            if not pinfo['aplicadas']:\n                return False\n            firmas = []\n            descartes = set()\n            racha = {}\n            exc_prev = {}\n            sucias = set(pares_por_eje.keys())\n            kos_s = verificar_pares(preps, zks, pares, p_trans)\n            exc_s = 0.0\n            for k_s in kos_s:\n                exc_s += k_s['exceso']\n            mov_s = 0\n            for e_s in range(len(preps)):\n                if zks[e_s] is None or zk_long[e_s] is None:\n                    continue\n                for a_s, b_s in zip(zks[e_s], zk_long[e_s]):\n                    mov_s += (a_s - b_s) if a_s >= b_s else (b_s - a_s)\n            score_s = (len(kos_s), round(exc_s, 3), mov_s)\n            if mejor is None or score_s < mejor[0]:\n                mejor = (score_s,\n                         [list(z) if z is not None else None\n                          for z in zks],\n                         eo['pasadas'])\n            return True\n\n        for pasada in range(1, max_pasadas + 1):\n            eo['pasadas'] = pasada\n            paso = PASO_EO\n            paso_sube = 0.0 if solo_desmonte else PASO_EO\n            cambio_max = 0\n            orden = orden_base if pasada % 2 == 1 else orden_base[::-1]\n            eo['wl_potencial'] += len(pares_por_eje)\n            for e in orden:\n                if e not in pares_por_eje or e not in sucias:\n                    continue\n                sucias.discard(e)\n                eo['wl_resueltas'] += 1\n                boxes = _cajas_para_eje(e, preps, zks, pares_por_eje[e],\n                                        p_trans, paso, descartes,\n                                        bases.get(e), paso_sube)\n                if boxes:\n                    nuevo = resolver_eje(preps[e], boxes)\n                else:\n                    # sin exigencias vivas: vuelve al optimo longitudinal\n                    nuevo = resolver_eje(preps[e])\n                if nuevo is None:\n                    s = 1\n                    while nuevo is None and s <= 16384:\n                        b2 = {i: (lo - s, hi + s)\n                              for i, (lo, hi) in boxes.items()}\n                        nuevo = resolver_eje(preps[e], b2)\n                        s *= 2\n                    eo['relajaciones'] += 1\n                if nuevo is None:\n                    eo['col_sin_resolver'] += 1\n                    continue\n                if nuevo != zks[e]:\n                    d = 0\n                    for a, b in zip(nuevo, zks[e]):\n                        ab = a - b\n                        if ab < 0:\n                            ab = -ab\n                        if ab > d:\n                            d = ab\n                    if d > cambio_max:\n                        cambio_max = d\n                    zks[e] = nuevo\n                    sucias.add(e)      # la region de confianza (PASO_EO)\n                    #                    puede dejarla a medio viaje: sigue\n                    #                    sucia hasta quedarse quieta\n                    for v_e in vecinos.get(e, ()):\n                        sucias.add(v_e)\n            kos_p = verificar_pares(preps, zks, pares, p_trans)\n            exc_p = 0.0\n            ko_keys = set()\n            for k in kos_p:\n                exc_p += k['exceso']\n                key = (k['pi'], k['end'])\n                ko_keys.add(key)\n                if key in descartes:\n                    continue\n                if key in exc_prev and k['exceso'] >= exc_prev[key] - 0.01:\n                    racha[key] = racha.get(key, 0) + 1\n                else:\n                    racha[key] = 1\n                exc_prev[key] = k['exceso']\n                if racha[key] >= 3:\n                    descartes.add(key)\n                    par_d = pares[key[0]]\n                    sucias.add(par_d['ea'])\n                    sucias.add(par_d['eb'])\n            for key in list(racha.keys()):\n                if key not in ko_keys:\n                    racha.pop(key, None)\n                    exc_prev.pop(key, None)\n            mov_p = 0\n            for e in range(len(preps)):\n                if zks[e] is None or zk_long[e] is None:\n                    continue\n                for a, b in zip(zks[e], zk_long[e]):\n                    mov_p += (a - b) if a >= b else (b - a)\n            exc_mx = 0.0\n            for k in kos_p:\n                if k['exceso'] > exc_mx:\n                    exc_mx = k['exceso']\n            eo.setdefault('_hist', []).append(\n                (pasada, len(kos_p), round(exc_mx, 3), round(exc_p, 2),\n                 mov_p, len(descartes)))\n            score = (len(kos_p), round(exc_p, 3), mov_p)\n            if mejor is None or score < mejor[0]:\n                mejor = (score,\n                         [list(z) if z is not None else None for z in zks],\n                         pasada)\n            if cambio_max <= 1:      # residuo <= 1 cm: etapa convergida\n                if solo_desmonte:\n                    solo_desmonte = False\n                    firmas = []\n                    descartes = set()\n                    racha = {}\n                    exc_prev = {}\n                    sucias = set(pares_por_eje.keys())\n                    eo['pasadas_desmonte'] = pasada\n                    continue\n                if cascadas < 3:\n                    mv, dmx = _cascada_arrastre(preps, zks, pares, p_trans,\n                                                bases, w_fill)\n                    if mv:\n                        cascadas += 1\n                        eo['arrastre_casc'] = cascadas\n                        eo['arrastre_cols'] += mv\n                        if dmx > eo['arrastre_max']:\n                            eo['arrastre_max'] = dmx\n                        firmas = []\n                        descartes = set()\n                        racha = {}\n                        exc_prev = {}\n                        sucias = set(pares_por_eje.keys())\n                        continue\n                if _peine_sweep():\n                    continue\n                convergio = True\n                break\n            firmas.append(hash(tuple(tuple(z) if z is not None else None\n                                     for z in zks)))\n            if len(firmas) >= 3 and firmas[-1] == firmas[-3]:\n                if solo_desmonte:\n                    solo_desmonte = False\n                    firmas = []\n                    descartes = set()\n                    racha = {}\n                    exc_prev = {}\n                    sucias = set(pares_por_eje.keys())\n                    eo['pasadas_desmonte'] = pasada\n                    continue\n                if cascadas < 3:\n                    mv, dmx = _cascada_arrastre(preps, zks, pares, p_trans,\n                                                bases, w_fill)\n                    if mv:\n                        cascadas += 1\n                        eo['arrastre_casc'] = cascadas\n                        eo['arrastre_cols'] += mv\n                        if dmx > eo['arrastre_max']:\n                            eo['arrastre_max'] = dmx\n                        firmas = []\n                        descartes = set()\n                        racha = {}\n                        exc_prev = {}\n                        sucias = set(pares_por_eje.keys())\n                        continue\n                if _peine_sweep():\n                    continue\n                break            # ciclo de periodo 2: estado ya visitado\n            if solo_desmonte and pasada >= max_pasadas // 2:\n                solo_desmonte = False\n                firmas = []\n                descartes = set()\n                racha = {}\n                exc_prev = {}\n                sucias = set(pares_por_eje.keys())\n                eo['pasadas_desmonte'] = pasada\n        if not convergio and cascadas < 3:\n            mv, dmx = _cascada_arrastre(preps, zks, pares, p_trans, bases,\n                                        w_fill)\n            if mv:\n                cascadas += 1\n                eo['arrastre_casc'] = cascadas\n                eo['arrastre_cols'] += mv\n                if dmx > eo['arrastre_max']:\n                    eo['arrastre_max'] = dmx\n                kos_p = verificar_pares(preps, zks, pares, p_trans)\n                exc_p = 0.0\n                for k in kos_p:\n                    exc_p += k['exceso']\n                mov_p = 0\n                for e in range(len(preps)):\n                    if zks[e] is None or zk_long[e] is None:\n                        continue\n                    for a, b in zip(zks[e], zk_long[e]):\n                        mov_p += (a - b) if a >= b else (b - a)\n                score = (len(kos_p), round(exc_p, 3), mov_p)\n                if mejor is None or score < mejor[0]:\n                    mejor = (score,\n                             [list(z) if z is not None else None\n                              for z in zks], eo['pasadas'])\n        eo['rescate'] = {'activo': False, 'ejes': 0, 'pares_obj': 0,\n                         'resueltos': 0, 'pasadas': 0}\n        if tol_rescate > tol_ext_m:\n            if mejor is not None:\n                zks = mejor[1]\n            kos0 = verificar_pares(preps, zks, pares, p_trans)\n            if kos0:\n                resc = eo['rescate']\n                resc['activo'] = True\n                resc['pares_obj'] = len(kos0)\n                tr_steps = int((tol_rescate + 1e-9) / GRID)\n                ejes_r = set()\n                for k in kos0:\n                    ejes_r.add(k['ea'])\n                    ejes_r.add(k['eb'])\n                ady_r = {}\n                for par in pares:\n                    ady_r.setdefault(par['ea'], set()).add(par['eb'])\n                    ady_r.setdefault(par['eb'], set()).add(par['ea'])\n                frente = list(ejes_r)\n                while frente:\n                    x = frente.pop()\n                    for v in ady_r.get(x, ()):\n                        if v not in ejes_r:\n                            ejes_r.add(v)\n                            frente.append(v)\n                resc['ejes'] = len(ejes_r)\n                for e in ejes_r:\n                    pr = preps[e]\n                    for idx in list(pr['anc_box'].keys()):\n                        tkv = pr['tk'][idx]\n                        pr['anc_box'][idx] = (tkv - tr_steps, tkv + tr_steps)\n                descartes = set()\n                racha = {}\n                exc_prev = {}\n                firmas = []\n                solo2 = True\n                casc2 = 0\n                for pas2 in range(1, max_pasadas + 1):\n                    resc['pasadas'] = pas2\n                    paso2 = 0.0 if solo2 else PASO_EO\n                    cambio_max = 0\n                    orden = orden_base if pas2 % 2 == 1 else orden_base[::-1]\n                    for e in orden:\n                        if e not in pares_por_eje:\n                            continue\n                        boxes = _cajas_para_eje(e, preps, zks,\n                                                pares_por_eje[e], p_trans,\n                                                PASO_EO, descartes,\n                                                bases.get(e), paso2)\n                        if boxes:\n                            nuevo = resolver_eje(preps[e], boxes)\n                        else:\n                            nuevo = resolver_eje(preps[e])\n                        if nuevo is None:\n                            s = 1\n                            while nuevo is None and s <= 16384:\n                                b2 = {i: (lo - s, hi + s)\n                                      for i, (lo, hi) in boxes.items()}\n                                nuevo = resolver_eje(preps[e], b2)\n                                s *= 2\n                            eo['relajaciones'] += 1\n                        if nuevo is None:\n                            eo['col_sin_resolver'] += 1\n                            continue\n                        if nuevo != zks[e]:\n                            d = 0\n                            for a, b in zip(nuevo, zks[e]):\n                                ab = a - b\n                                if ab < 0:\n                                    ab = -ab\n                                if ab > d:\n                                    d = ab\n                            if d > cambio_max:\n                                cambio_max = d\n                            zks[e] = nuevo\n                    kos_p = verificar_pares(preps, zks, pares, p_trans)\n                    exc_p = 0.0\n                    ko_keys = set()\n                    for k in kos_p:\n                        exc_p += k['exceso']\n                        key = (k['pi'], k['end'])\n                        ko_keys.add(key)\n                        if key in descartes:\n                            continue\n                        if key in exc_prev \\\n                                and k['exceso'] >= exc_prev[key] - 0.01:\n                            racha[key] = racha.get(key, 0) + 1\n                        else:\n                            racha[key] = 1\n                        exc_prev[key] = k['exceso']\n                        if racha[key] >= 3:\n                            descartes.add(key)\n                    for key in list(racha.keys()):\n                        if key not in ko_keys:\n                            racha.pop(key, None)\n                            exc_prev.pop(key, None)\n                    mov_p = 0\n                    for e in range(len(preps)):\n                        if zks[e] is None or zk_long[e] is None:\n                            continue\n                        for a, b in zip(zks[e], zk_long[e]):\n                            mov_p += (a - b) if a >= b else (b - a)\n                    score = (len(kos_p), round(exc_p, 3), mov_p)\n                    if mejor is None or score < mejor[0]:\n                        mejor = (score,\n                                 [list(z) if z is not None else None\n                                  for z in zks],\n                                 eo['pasadas'] + pas2)\n                    if cambio_max <= 1:\n                        if solo2:\n                            solo2 = False\n                            firmas = []\n                            descartes = set()\n                            racha = {}\n                            exc_prev = {}\n                            continue\n                        if casc2 < 3:\n                            mv, dmx = _cascada_arrastre(preps, zks, pares,\n                                                        p_trans, bases,\n                                                        w_fill)\n                            if mv:\n                                casc2 += 1\n                                eo['arrastre_casc'] += 1\n                                eo['arrastre_cols'] += mv\n                                if dmx > eo['arrastre_max']:\n                                    eo['arrastre_max'] = dmx\n                                firmas = []\n                                descartes = set()\n                                racha = {}\n                                exc_prev = {}\n                                continue\n                        break\n                    firmas.append(hash(tuple(tuple(z) if z is not None\n                                             else None for z in zks)))\n                    if len(firmas) >= 3 and firmas[-1] == firmas[-3]:\n                        if solo2:\n                            solo2 = False\n                            firmas = []\n                            descartes = set()\n                            racha = {}\n                            exc_prev = {}\n                            continue\n                        if casc2 < 3:\n                            mv, dmx = _cascada_arrastre(preps, zks, pares,\n                                                        p_trans, bases,\n                                                        w_fill)\n                            if mv:\n                                casc2 += 1\n                                eo['arrastre_casc'] += 1\n                                eo['arrastre_cols'] += mv\n                                if dmx > eo['arrastre_max']:\n                                    eo['arrastre_max'] = dmx\n                                firmas = []\n                                descartes = set()\n                                racha = {}\n                                exc_prev = {}\n                                continue\n                        break\n                    if solo2 and pas2 >= max_pasadas // 2:\n                        solo2 = False\n                        firmas = []\n                        descartes = set()\n                        racha = {}\n                        exc_prev = {}\n        if eo.get('rescate', {}).get('activo') \\\n                and eo.get('arrastre_casc', 0) < 6:\n            mv, dmx = _cascada_arrastre(preps, zks, pares, p_trans, bases,\n                                        w_fill)\n            if mv:\n                eo['arrastre_casc'] = eo.get('arrastre_casc', 0) + 1\n                eo['arrastre_cols'] += mv\n                if dmx > eo['arrastre_max']:\n                    eo['arrastre_max'] = dmx\n                kos_p = verificar_pares(preps, zks, pares, p_trans)\n                exc_p = 0.0\n                for k in kos_p:\n                    exc_p += k['exceso']\n                mov_p = 0\n                for e in range(len(preps)):\n                    if zks[e] is None or zk_long[e] is None:\n                        continue\n                    for a, b in zip(zks[e], zk_long[e]):\n                        mov_p += (a - b) if a >= b else (b - a)\n                score = (len(kos_p), round(exc_p, 3), mov_p)\n                if mejor is None or score < mejor[0]:\n                    mejor = (score,\n                             [list(z) if z is not None else None\n                              for z in zks],\n                             eo['pasadas'] + eo['rescate']['pasadas'])\n        if mejor is not None:\n            zks = mejor[1]\n            eo['mejor_pasada'] = mejor[2]\n        # ---- v18: PEINE EO (rescate por filas) --------------------------\n        try:\n            if verificar_pares(preps, zks, pares, p_trans):\n                eo['peine'] = _peine_eo(preps, zks, pares, p_trans,\n                                        bases, w_fill)\n        except Exception as ex_pe:\n            eo['peine'] = {'error': str(ex_pe)[:120], 'kos_ini': 1,\n                           'kos_fin': 1, 'filas': 0, 'aplicadas': 0,\n                           'mesas_movidas': 0, 'dmax': 0.0,\n                           'ampliaciones': 0, 'infactibles': 0}\n        eo['descartes'] = len(descartes)\n        eo['_desc'] = descartes\n        eo['convergio'] = convergio\n        eo['ko_pares'] = verificar_pares(preps, zks, pares, p_trans)\n        if eo.get('rescate', {}).get('activo'):\n            eo['rescate']['resueltos'] = max(\n                0, eo['rescate']['pares_obj'] - len(eo['ko_pares']))\n        eo['autopsias'] = autopsia_kos(preps, zks, pares, p_trans, bases,\n                                       eo['ko_pares'])\n        movidos = 0\n        for e in range(len(preps)):\n            if zks[e] is None or zk_long[e] is None:\n                continue\n            for i in range(len(zks[e])):\n                if zks[e][i] != zk_long[e][i]:\n                    movidos += 1\n        eo['nodos_movidos_eo'] = movidos\n\n    # v22: pulido de deflexiones de hincas (flexibles) tras todo el\n    # optimizador (LONG+EO+peine+rescate). Solo-mejora respecto a pares.\n    try:\n        eo['deflex'] = _pulir_deflexiones_planta(\n            preps, zks, pares if eo.get('activa') else [], p_trans)\n    except Exception as ex_dfx:\n        eo['deflex'] = {'error': str(ex_dfx)[:120]}\n\n    ejes_out = []\n    for e, prep in enumerate(preps):\n        if prep['status'] == 'KO':\n            ejes_out.append({'status': 'KO', 'msg': prep['msg'], 'res': [],\n                             'anc': {'a_mov': None, 'b_mov': None},\n                             'stats': prep.get('stats', {})})\n        else:\n            res_e = clasificar_eje(prep, zks[e], zk_long[e])\n            if 'rescate' in prep:\n                res_e['rescate'] = prep['rescate']\n            ejes_out.append(res_e)\n    try:\n        eo['recos'] = _recomendaciones(\n            preps, zks, pares if eo.get('activa') else [],\n            p_trans, bases if eo.get('activa') else {}, eo, ejes_out,\n            p_long, tol_ext_m, tol_rescate, pitch, margen, w_fill,\n            escalon_m, gap_cont_m, max_pasadas)\n    except Exception as ex:\n        eo['recos'] = ['(recomendaciones no disponibles: '\n                       + str(ex)[:90] + ')']\n    return {'ejes': ejes_out, 'eo': eo, '_preps': preps, '_zks': zks}\n\n\ndef autopsia_kos(preps, zks, pares, p_trans, bases, kos):\n    \"\"\"Para cada par KO final: cierre necesario, movilidad efectiva de cada\n    lado (desplazamiento uniforme de su columna, el modelo de la cascada),\n    que la limita (tope de ancla, tope MOV o el par vecino mas justo) y\n    veredicto estructural. Solo diagnostico: no mueve nada.\"\"\"\n    out = []\n    if not kos:\n        return out\n    modo = pares[0]['modo']\n    MOVK = int((_MOV_EFF + 1e-9) / GRID)\n\n    def cuerda(e, t, s):\n        prep = preps[e]\n        tr = prep['trs'][t]\n        sa, sb, _ = _geo_tracker(tr, modo)\n        za = z_ext(prep, zks[e], 2 * t)\n        zb = z_ext(prep, zks[e], 2 * t + 1)\n        return _interp_z(sa, za, sb, zb, s)\n\n    def movilidad(e, subir, pi_skip):\n        prep = preps[e]\n        zk = zks[e]\n        cap = 10.0\n        etq = 'sin tope cercano'\n        for idx, (alo, ahi) in prep['anc_box'].items():\n            h = ((ahi - zk[idx]) if subir else (zk[idx] - alo)) * GRID\n            if h < cap:\n                cap = h\n                etq = 'ancla %s al tope' % ('N' if idx == 0 else 'S')\n        base = bases.get(e)\n        if base is not None:\n            for i in range(len(zk)):\n                bk = _round_half_up((base[i] - prep['z_ref']) / GRID)\n                h = ((bk + MOVK - zk[i]) if subir\n                     else (zk[i] - (bk - MOVK))) * GRID\n                if h < cap:\n                    cap = h\n                    etq = 'tope MOV +-%.1f m' % _MOV_EFF\n        vecs = []\n        for j, par in enumerate(pares):\n            if j == pi_skip:\n                continue\n            if par['ea'] == e:\n                yo_t, oe, ot = par['ta'], par['eb'], par['tb']\n            elif par['eb'] == e:\n                yo_t, oe, ot = par['tb'], par['ea'], par['ta']\n            else:\n                continue\n            L = p_trans * par['d'] + 0.011\n            m_dir = 10.0\n            marg = 10.0\n            for s2 in (par['s_lo'], par['s_hi']):\n                g = cuerda(e, yo_t, s2) - cuerda(oe, ot, s2)\n                a = (L - g) if subir else (L + g)\n                if a < m_dir:\n                    m_dir = a\n                mg = L - (g if g >= 0 else -g)\n                if mg < marg:\n                    marg = mg\n            vecs.append((m_dir, marg, preps[oe]['trs'][ot]['id']))\n        vecs.sort()\n        if vecs and vecs[0][0] < cap:\n            cap = vecs[0][0]\n            etq = 'par con %s (margen %.2f m)' % (vecs[0][2], vecs[0][1])\n        if cap < 0.0:\n            cap = 0.0\n        top = [(v[2], round(v[1], 2)) for v in vecs[:3]]\n        return cap, etq, top\n\n    for k in kos:\n        par = pares[k['pi']]\n        zi = cuerda(par['ea'], par['ta'], k['s'])\n        zj = cuerda(par['eb'], par['tb'], k['s'])\n        if zi >= zj:\n            alto, t_al = par['ea'], par['ta']\n            bajo, t_ba = par['eb'], par['tb']\n        else:\n            alto, t_al = par['eb'], par['tb']\n            bajo, t_ba = par['ea'], par['ta']\n        m_al, l_al, v_al = movilidad(alto, False, k['pi'])\n        m_ba, l_ba, v_ba = movilidad(bajo, True, k['pi'])\n        falta = k['exceso'] - m_al - m_ba\n        out.append({'ida': preps[alto]['trs'][t_al]['id'],\n                    'idb': preps[bajo]['trs'][t_ba]['id'],\n                    'pi': k['pi'], 'e_alto': alto, 'e_bajo': bajo,\n                    's': k['s'], 'dz': k['dz'], 'lim': k['lim'],\n                    'exceso': k['exceso'],\n                    'mov_alto': round(m_al, 2), 'lim_alto': l_al,\n                    'vecinos_alto': v_al,\n                    'mov_bajo': round(m_ba, 2), 'lim_bajo': l_ba,\n                    'vecinos_bajo': v_ba,\n                    'faltan': round(falta if falta > 0 else 0.0, 2)})\n    return out\n\n\ndef _pasadas_para(tol_eff, base):\n    n = 25 + int(20.0 * tol_eff)\n    p = int(base)\n    if n > p:\n        p = n\n    return 120 if p > 120 else p\n\n\ndef _sube05(x):\n    n = int((x + 0.0499) / 0.05)\n    return n * 0.05\n\n\n# Prioridades pactadas (LYNKA): P1 MAX_PASADAS_EO -> P2 TOL_RESCATE ->\n# P3 ESCALON_MAX (solo si la junta del tracker lo admite) -> IMPLANTACION.\n# FIJOS (nunca se recomiendan): pitch/ventana, TOL_AGRUPACION,\n# GAP_CONTIGUO, SOLAPE_MIN, RUGOSIDAD y las PENDIENTES limite.\ndef _recomendaciones(preps, zks, pares, p_trans, bases, eo, res_ejes,\n                     p_long, tol_ext_m, tol_rescate, pitch, margen,\n                     w_fill, escalon_m, gap_cont_m, max_pasadas=30):\n    \"\"\"Acciones SOLO sobre los inputs modificables, por prioridad:\n      P1 MAX_PASADAS_EO (solo tiempo)  ->  P2 TOL_RESCATE (tierras\n      quirurgicas en lo KO)  ->  P3 TOL_EXTREMOS (alternativa global,\n      menos quirurgica)  ->  IMPLANTACION (ningun input llega).\n    FIJOS por decision de proyecto (nunca se recomiendan): PITCH/MARGEN,\n    TOL_AGRUPACION, GAP_CONTIGUO, SOLAPE_MIN, ESCALON_MAX, RUGOSIDAD y\n    las PENDIENTES. Estimaciones estaticas: verificar en dry-run.\"\"\"\n    recos = []\n    eff = tol_rescate if tol_rescate > tol_ext_m else tol_ext_m\n    aus = eo.get('autopsias') or []\n\n    acop = [a for a in aus if a['faltan'] <= 0]\n    if acop:\n        ids = ', '.join('%s<->%s' % (a['ida'], a['idb'])\n                        for a in acop[:4])\n        if len(acop) > 4:\n            ids += ', ...'\n        sug = int((max_pasadas * 1.5 + 9.0) // 10) * 10\n        recos.append('P1: SUBE MAX_PASADAS_EO a %d (solo tiempo): %d '\n                     'par(es) con movilidad suficiente y residuo de '\n                     'acople (%s).' % (sug, len(acop), ids))\n\n    defs = []\n    for r in res_ejes:\n        if r.get('status') == 'KO':\n            dm = (r.get('stats') or {}).get('deficit_m')\n            if dm:\n                defs.append(dm)\n    p2_val = None\n    if defs:\n        p2_val = _sube05(max(d / 2.0 for d in defs))\n        recos.append('P2: ACTIVA/SUBE TOL_RESCATE a >= %.2f m: '\n                     'rescataria %d eje(s) KO por deficit (los que '\n                     'excedan iran a pendiente minima, etiqueta '\n                     'RESCATADO).' % (p2_val, len(defs)))\n    estructurales = [a for a in aus if a['faltan'] > 0]\n    sin_tol = False\n    parcial = None\n    hallado = None\n    if estructurales and pares:\n        for extra in (0.05, 0.10, 0.15, 0.20, 0.30, 0.40, 0.50,\n                      0.75, 1.0, 1.5, 2.0):\n            ok, tot = _cascada_arrastre(preps, zks, pares, p_trans, bases,\n                                        w_fill, dry_extra=extra)\n            if tot and ok == tot:\n                hallado = (extra, tot)\n                break\n            if tot and ok > 0 and parcial is None:\n                parcial = (extra, ok, tot)\n        if hallado is not None:\n            v = _sube05(eff + hallado[0])\n            if p2_val is None or v > p2_val:\n                p2_val = v\n            aviso = (' (ATENCION: escalada grande, valora '\n                     'implantacion)' if hallado[0] > 0.50 else '')\n            recos.append('P2: SUBE TOL_RESCATE a %.2f m: haria factible '\n                         'el re-tilt de los %d componente(s) con pares '\n                         'KO.%s' % (v, hallado[1], aviso))\n        elif parcial is not None:\n            v = _sube05(eff + parcial[0])\n            if p2_val is None or v > p2_val:\n                p2_val = v\n            recos.append('P2: SUBE TOL_RESCATE a %.2f m: desbloquearia '\n                         '%d de %d componente(s) con KO; el resto pasa '\n                         'a IMPLANTACION.' % (v, parcial[1], parcial[2]))\n            sin_tol = True\n        else:\n            recos.append('P2: ningun TOL_RESCATE (probado hasta +2.00 m) '\n                         'hace factible el re-tilt.')\n            sin_tol = True\n\n    if p2_val is not None:\n        recos.append('P3 (alternativa, menos quirurgica): TOL_EXTREMOS = '\n                     '%.2f m hace lo mismo en fase normal, moviendo '\n                     'tambien columnas sanas.' % p2_val)\n\n    if sin_tol and estructurales:\n        cab = 'IMPLANTACION (ningun input modificable llega):'\n        if parcial is not None:\n            cab = ('IMPLANTACION (para los componentes que el TOL no '\n                   'desbloquea; verifica cuales en dry-run):')\n        recos.append(cab)\n        for a in estructurales:\n            if p_trans > 0:\n                recos.append('   %s<->%s: separar filas a >= %.1f m '\n                             '(hoy %.1f) para el %.0f %%, talud entre '\n                             'filas, o recolocar la mesa.'\n                             % (a['ida'], a['idb'], a['dz'] / p_trans,\n                                a['lim'] / p_trans, p_trans * 100.0))\n\n    peffs = [r['rescate']['p_eff'] for r in res_ejes\n             if r.get('rescate')\n             and r['rescate'].get('tipo') == 'PENDIENTE']\n    if peffs:\n        recos.append('NOTA: %d eje(s) RESCATADOS por pendiente minima '\n                     '(hasta %.2f %% > %.2f %%): las pendientes son dato '\n                     'fijo -> si no se admite, es implantacion en esos '\n                     'ejes.' % (len(peffs), max(peffs) * 100.0,\n                                p_long * 100.0))\n    if pares and eo.get('activa') and len(preps) > 1:\n        modo = pares[0]['modo']\n        cs = []\n        for prep in preps:\n            if prep['status'] != 'OK':\n                continue\n            vals = [_geo_tracker(tr, modo)[2] for tr in prep['trs']]\n            cs.append(sum(vals) / len(vals))\n        cs.sort()\n        win_lo = pitch - margen\n        win_hi = pitch + margen\n        fuera = []\n        for i in range(len(cs) - 1):\n            dnb = cs[i + 1] - cs[i]\n            if win_hi < dnb <= 12.0 or 2.0 <= dnb < win_lo:\n                fuera.append(dnb)\n        if fuera:\n            recos.append('INFO (ventana fija [%.1f, %.1f]): %d hueco(s) '\n                         'entre columnas de %.1f-%.1f m quedan sin '\n                         'vigilar (dato, no accion).'\n                         % (win_lo, win_hi, len(fuera), min(fuera),\n                            max(fuera)))\n    # -------- receta para el resumen y el MODO FORZAR --------------------\n    if acop:\n        eo['receta_pasadas'] = int((max_pasadas * 1.5 + 9.0) // 10) * 10\n    else:\n        eo['receta_pasadas'] = int(max_pasadas)\n    full_ok = (not estructurales) or (hallado is not None)\n    eo['receta_tol_total'] = p2_val if (p2_val is not None\n                                        and full_ok) else None\n    if eo['receta_tol_total'] is not None:\n        eo['receta_pasadas'] = _pasadas_para(eo['receta_tol_total'],\n                                             eo['receta_pasadas'])\n    eo['receta_estructural'] = (\n        [(a['ida'], a['idb']) for a in estructurales]\n        if (estructurales and hallado is None) else [])\n    return recos\n\n\ndef procesar_planta_forzar(ejes_trs, modo, p_long, p_trans,\n                           escalon_m, gap_cont_m, tol_ext_m, pitch,\n                           margen, solape_min, max_pasadas, w_anc=10,\n                           rug_m=0.0, tol_rescate=0.0,\n                           p_hincas=None):\n    \"\"\"MODO FORZAR: reintentos completos escalando SOLO las palancas\n    modificables (P1 MAX_PASADAS, P2 TOL_RESCATE via la receta de cada\n    pasada) hasta cumplir toda la planta o agotar la escalada. Los\n    inputs fijos jamas se tocan; el objetivo de tierras se desactiva.\n    Devuelve (rp_mejor, receta_verificada). Determinista.\"\"\"\n    def kos_de(rp):\n        n_e = sum(1 for r in rp['ejes'] if r.get('status') == 'KO')\n        kop = rp['eo'].get('ko_pares') or []\n        exc = 0.0\n        for k in kop:\n            exc += k['exceso']\n        return n_e + len(kop), round(exc, 3)\n\n    tolr = tol_rescate if tol_rescate > tol_ext_m else tol_ext_m\n    if tolr < 0.0:\n        tolr = 0.0\n    pas = _pasadas_para(tolr, max_pasadas)\n    intentos = []\n    mejor = None\n    for _paso in range(4):\n        rp = procesar_planta(ejes_trs, modo, p_long, p_trans, escalon_m,\n                             gap_cont_m, tol_ext_m, pitch, margen,\n                             solape_min, 'LONG+EO', pas, w_fill=3,\n                             w_anc=w_anc, rug_m=rug_m, tol_rescate=tolr, p_hincas=p_hincas)\n        n, exc = kos_de(rp)\n        intentos.append((round(tolr, 2), pas, n, exc))\n        clave = (n, exc)\n        if mejor is None or clave < mejor[0]:\n            mejor = (clave, rp, round(tolr, 2), pas)\n        if n == 0:\n            break\n        eo = rp['eo']\n        obj = eo.get('receta_tol_total')\n        pas_obj = eo.get('receta_pasadas') or pas\n        subio = False\n        if obj is not None and obj > tolr + 1e-9:\n            tolr = obj\n            p2 = _pasadas_para(tolr, pas)\n            if p2 > pas:\n                pas = p2\n            subio = True\n        if pas_obj > pas:\n            pas = min(int(pas_obj), 120)\n            subio = True\n        if not subio:\n            if pas < min(2 * int(max_pasadas), 120):\n                pas = min(2 * int(max_pasadas), 120)\n            else:\n                break\n    clave, rp, tolr_f, pas_f = mejor\n    receta = {'cumple': clave[0] == 0,\n              'tol_ini': round(tol_rescate if tol_rescate > 0.0\n                               else 0.0, 2),\n              'pas_ini': int(max_pasadas),\n              'tol_fin': tolr_f, 'pas_fin': pas_f,\n              'intentos': intentos, 'kos': clave[0],\n              'irreducibles': [(k['ida'], k['idb'])\n                               for k in (rp['eo'].get('ko_pares')\n                                         or [])]}\n    return rp, receta\n\n\ndef escenarios_comparativos(ejes_trs, modo, p_long, p_trans,\n                            escalon_m, gap_cont_m, pitch, margen,\n                            solape_min, max_pasadas, w_anc, rug_m,\n                            tol_ext_m, tol_rescate, rp_real,\n                            p_hincas=None):\n    \"\"\"Escenarios automaticos resueltos DE VERDAD y NO aplicados, para\n    comparar con la pasada real cuando esta deja KOs:\n      CASO A (quirurgico): EXTREMO actual + RESCATE = receta.\n      CASO B (global):     EXTREMO = RESCATE = receta (fase normal).\n    Ratio de tierras desactivado en los casos (se reporta el logrado).\n    Devuelve lista de filas de metricas (REAL primero). Determinista.\"\"\"\n    def met(rp, ext, resc, pas, nombre):\n        n_e = sum(1 for r in rp['ejes'] if r.get('status') == 'KO')\n        kop = rp['eo'].get('ko_pares') or []\n        D = T = 0.0\n        anc_n = 0\n        anc_mx = 0.0\n        dzmx = 0.0\n        for r in rp['ejes']:\n            if r.get('status') != 'OK':\n                continue\n            st = r['stats']\n            D += st.get('mt_desmonte', 0.0)\n            T += st.get('mt_terraplen', 0.0)\n            for mv in (r['anc']['a_mov'], r['anc']['b_mov']):\n                if mv is not None:\n                    anc_n += 1\n                    if abs(mv) > anc_mx:\n                        anc_mx = abs(mv)\n            for x in r['res']:\n                for dz in (x['dza'], x['dzb']):\n                    if abs(dz) > dzmx:\n                        dzmx = abs(dz)\n        return {'nombre': nombre, 'ext': ext, 'resc': resc, 'pas': pas,\n                'kos': n_e + len(kop), 'D': round(D, 2),\n                'T': round(T, 2), 'anc_n': anc_n,\n                'anc_max': round(anc_mx, 2), 'dzmax': round(dzmx, 2)}\n\n    eo = rp_real['eo']\n    base_eff = tol_rescate if tol_rescate > tol_ext_m else tol_ext_m\n    obj = eo.get('receta_tol_total')\n    if obj is None:\n        obj = _sube05(base_eff + 0.50)\n    pas = int(eo.get('receta_pasadas') or max_pasadas)\n    if pas < int(max_pasadas):\n        pas = int(max_pasadas)\n    real_c = (round(tol_ext_m, 2), round(tol_rescate, 2))\n    combos = []\n    for c in ((round(tol_ext_m, 2), round(obj, 2)),\n              (round(obj, 2), round(obj, 2))):\n        if c == real_c and pas == int(max_pasadas):\n            continue\n        if c not in combos:\n            combos.append(c)\n    filas = [met(rp_real, real_c[0], real_c[1], int(max_pasadas),\n                 'REAL')]\n    letras = ('CASO A', 'CASO B', 'CASO C')\n    for i in range(len(combos[:3])):\n        ext, resc = combos[i]\n        mx = ext if ext > resc else resc\n        pas_c = _pasadas_para(mx, pas)\n        rp = procesar_planta(ejes_trs, modo, p_long, p_trans, escalon_m,\n                             gap_cont_m, ext, pitch, margen, solape_min,\n                             'LONG+EO', pas_c, w_fill=3, w_anc=w_anc,\n                             rug_m=rug_m, tol_rescate=resc, p_hincas=p_hincas)\n        filas.append(met(rp, ext, resc, pas_c, letras[i]))\n    return filas\n\n\nESCALERA_PESOS = [(6, 1), (4, 1), (3, 1), (2, 1), (3, 2), (6, 5), (1, 1),\n                  (5, 6), (2, 3), (1, 2), (1, 3), (1, 4), (1, 5), (1, 6),\n                  (1, 7), (1, 8), (1, 10)]\n\n\ndef procesar_planta_ratio(ejes_trs, modo, p_long, p_trans, escalon_m,\n                          gap_cont_m, tol_ext_m, pitch, margen, solape_min,\n                          fase, max_pasadas, ratio_obj=1.2, ratio_tol=0.1,\n                          w_anc=10, rug_m=0.0, tol_rescate=0.0,\n                          p_hincas=None):\n    \"\"\"Busca por biseccion sobre una escalera de precios corte/relleno el\n    resultado cuyo ratio de MOV. DE TIERRAS desmonte/terraplen cae en\n    [obj - tol, obj + tol]. Si la geometria/anclas no lo permiten, adopta\n    el mas cercano (desempate: menos tierras) y lo marca fuera de banda.\n    Determinista; <= ~5 optimizaciones completas.\"\"\"\n    def medir(rp):\n        D = T = 0.0\n        for g in rp['ejes']:\n            if g['status'] != 'OK':\n                continue\n            D += g['stats'].get('mt_desmonte', 0.0)\n            T += g['stats'].get('mt_terraplen', 0.0)\n        return D, T\n\n    cache = {}\n\n    def correr(i):\n        if i in cache:\n            return cache[i]\n        wd, wu = ESCALERA_PESOS[i]\n        rp = procesar_planta(ejes_trs, modo, p_long, p_trans, escalon_m,\n                             gap_cont_m, tol_ext_m, pitch, margen,\n                             solape_min, fase, max_pasadas, w_fill=wu,\n                             w_anc=w_anc, rug_m=rug_m,\n                             tol_rescate=tol_rescate, w_cut=wd, p_hincas=p_hincas)\n        D, T = medir(rp)\n        if D + T < 0.05:\n            r = None\n        elif T <= 1e-9:\n            r = float('inf')\n        elif D <= 1e-9:\n            r = 0.0\n        else:\n            r = D / T\n        cache[i] = (rp, r, D, T, (wd, wu))\n        return cache[i]\n\n    info = {'activo': True, 'objetivo': ratio_obj, 'tol': ratio_tol,\n            'historial': [], 'en_banda': False, 'nota': ''}\n    if ratio_obj <= 0:\n        rp = procesar_planta(ejes_trs, modo, p_long, p_trans, escalon_m,\n                             gap_cont_m, tol_ext_m, pitch, margen,\n                             solape_min, fase, max_pasadas, w_fill=1,\n                             w_anc=w_anc, rug_m=rug_m,\n                             tol_rescate=tol_rescate, w_cut=1, p_hincas=p_hincas)\n        info['activo'] = False\n        info['nota'] = 'sin objetivo de ratio (pesos neutros 1/1)'\n        info['logrado'] = -1.0\n        info['iteraciones'] = 1\n        return rp, info\n    lo, hi = 0, len(ESCALERA_PESOS) - 1\n    elegido = None\n    while lo <= hi:\n        i = (lo + hi) // 2\n        rp, r, D, T, pesos = correr(i)\n        info['historial'].append((pesos[0], pesos[1],\n                                  -1.0 if r is None else r,\n                                  round(D, 2), round(T, 2)))\n        if r is None:\n            info['nota'] = ('movimiento de tierras despreciable: el ratio '\n                            'no aplica')\n            elegido = i\n            break\n        if ratio_obj - ratio_tol <= r <= ratio_obj + ratio_tol:\n            info['en_banda'] = True\n            elegido = i\n            break\n        if r < ratio_obj:\n            lo = i + 1      # falta desmonte -> encarecer el relleno\n        else:\n            hi = i - 1      # sobra desmonte -> abaratar el relleno\n    if elegido is None:\n        mejor = None\n        for i in cache:\n            rp_i, r, D, T, pesos = cache[i]\n            rv = 999.0 if (r is None or r == float('inf')) else r\n            key = (abs(rv - ratio_obj), D + T, i)\n            if mejor is None or key < mejor[0]:\n                mejor = (key, i)\n        elegido = mejor[1]\n        info['nota'] = ('objetivo inalcanzable con esta geometria/anclas: '\n                        'se adopta el mas cercano')\n    rp, r, D, T, pesos = cache[elegido]\n    info['logrado'] = -1.0 if r is None else r\n    info['D'] = D\n    info['T'] = T\n    info['pesos'] = pesos\n    info['iteraciones'] = len(cache)\n    return rp, info\n\n\n\n# =============================================================================\n\n# CAPA CIVIL 3D\n# =============================================================================\ndef _txt(v, dflt=''):\n    if v is None:\n        return dflt\n    s = str(v).strip()\n    return s if s else dflt\n\n\ndef _num(v, dflt):\n    if v is None:\n        return float(dflt)\n    if isinstance(v, bool):\n        return float(dflt)\n    if isinstance(v, (int, float)):\n        return float(v)\n    s = str(v).strip().replace(',', '.')\n    try:\n        return float(s)\n    except Exception:\n        return float(dflt)\n\n\ndef _boo(v):\n    if isinstance(v, bool):\n        return v\n    return str(v).strip().lower() in ('true', '1', 'si', 'sí', 'yes', 'y')\n\n\ndef _match(nombre, patron):\n    if not nombre:\n        return False\n    for p in [x.strip() for x in patron.split(',') if x.strip()]:\n        if p.endswith('*'):\n            if nombre.startswith(p[:-1]):\n                return True\n        elif nombre == p:\n            return True\n    return False\n\n\ndef _pts_de_fl(fl):\n    \"\"\"Puntos de la FL: cascada probada StartPoint/EndPoint <- GetPoints.\"\"\"\n    lista = []\n    pts = None\n    if PIPOINT is not None:\n        try:\n            pts = fl.GetPoints(PIPOINT)\n        except Exception:\n            pts = None\n    if pts is None:\n        try:\n            pts = fl.GetPoints()\n        except Exception:\n            pts = None\n    if pts is not None:\n        try:\n            for k in range(pts.Count):\n                p = pts[k]\n                lista.append((p.X, p.Y, p.Z))\n        except Exception:\n            try:\n                en = pts.GetEnumerator()\n                while en.MoveNext():\n                    p = en.Current\n                    lista.append((p.X, p.Y, p.Z))\n            except Exception:\n                lista = []\n    if len(lista) < 2:\n        sp = fl.StartPoint\n        ep = fl.EndPoint\n        lista = [(sp.X, sp.Y, sp.Z), (ep.X, ep.Y, ep.Z)]\n    return lista\n\n\ndef _busca_superficie(tr, cdoc, nombre):\n    sids = cdoc.GetSurfaceIds()\n    nombres = []\n    for i in range(sids.Count):\n        try:\n            o = tr.GetObject(sids[i], OpenMode.ForRead)\n            nm = ''\n            try:\n                nm = o.Name\n            except Exception:\n                nm = ''\n            nombres.append(nm)\n            if nm == nombre:\n                return o, nombres\n        except Exception:\n            nombres.append('<error lectura>')\n    return None, nombres\n\n\ndef run():\n    log = []\n    T = {}\n    t00 = time.perf_counter()\n\n    MODO = _txt(IN[0], 'NS').upper()\n    PATRON = _txt(IN[1], 'FL_T*')\n    MDT_N = _txt(IN[2], '')\n    SUP_TR = _txt(IN[3], '')\n    P_NS = _num(IN[4], 12.0)\n    P_EO = _num(IN[5], 8.0)\n    PITCH = _num(IN[6], 4.0)\n    MPITCH = _num(IN[7], 1.0)\n    ESC = _num(IN[8], 0.02)\n    GAPC = _num(IN[9], 0.5)\n    TOLE = _num(IN[10], 0.0)\n    TOLA = _num(IN[11], 0.2)\n    APL = _boo(IN[12])\n    FASE = _txt(IN[13], 'LONG').upper().replace(' ', '')\n    FORZAR_M = _boo(IN[14]) or 'FORZAR' in FASE\n    MAXP = _num(IN[15], 30.0)\n    SOLAPE_MIN = _num(IN[16], 1.0)\n    RATIO = _num(IN[17], 1.2)\n    RUG = max(0.0, _num(IN[18], 0.0))\n    TOLR = max(0.0, _num(IN[19], 0.0))\n    TOLRAT = max(0.01, _num(IN[20], 0.1))\n    D_HINCA = _num(IN[21], 1.31) if len(IN) > 21 else 1.31\n    if D_HINCA <= 0:\n        D_HINCA = 1.31\n    D_ALA = _num(IN[22], 13.96) if len(IN) > 22 else 13.96\n    if D_ALA <= 0:\n        D_ALA = 13.96\n    DEFLEX_CFG['d_h'] = D_HINCA / 100.0\n    DEFLEX_CFG['d_ala'] = D_ALA / 100.0\n    # v23: guardarrail de unidades. La rugosidad es una banda fisica de la\n    # hinca: mas de 5 m no es real; casi seguro llego en mm (Excel). Se\n    # convierte y se avisa en gigante para que se corrija la hoja.\n    if RUG > 5.0:\n        log.append('!!!!!! RUGOSIDAD %.2f m NO ES FISICA: se interpreta '\n                   'como mm -> %.3f m. CORRIGE LA HOJA (rugosidad_m en '\n                   'METROS).' % (RUG, RUG / 1000.0))\n        RUG = RUG / 1000.0\n    DEFLEX_CFG['tol_ext'] = max(TOLE, 0.0)\n    DEFLEX_CFG['esc'] = ESC\n    DEFLEX_CFG['gapc'] = GAPC\n\n    log.append('=== 3_CorreccionPendientes v24 ===')\n    if MODO not in ('NS', 'EO'):\n        log.append('!!!! MODO \"%s\" no valido (usa \"NS\" o \"EO\"). Abortado.' % MODO)\n        return '\\n'.join(log)\n    p_frac = (P_NS if MODO == 'NS' else P_EO) / 100.0\n    # v22 flexibles: vano <= pendiente general (techo absoluto) => cuerda\n    # <= general por construccion; deflexiones por PULIDO post-optimizador.\n    log.append('FLEXIBLES: techo por vano = p_max long %.2f %% | deflexion '\n               'por hinca <= %.2f %% (%.2f gr) | acumulada por ala <= '\n               '%.2f %% (%.2f gr) | motora = vertice central (su quiebro '\n               'no computa en las alas)'\n               % (p_frac * 100.0, D_HINCA,\n                  math.degrees(math.atan(D_HINCA / 100.0)),\n                  D_ALA, math.degrees(math.atan(D_ALA / 100.0))))\n    log.append('Modo %s | p_max long = %.2f %% | escalon = %.3f m | '\n               'gap contiguo = %.2f m' % (MODO, p_frac * 100.0, ESC, GAPC))\n    log.append('Patron FL: %s | MDT: %s | Sup. trackers: %s'\n               % (PATRON, MDT_N if MDT_N else '(vacio)',\n                  SUP_TR if SUP_TR else '(vacio: sin rebuild)'))\n    log.append('TOL_EXTREMOS = %.2f m | agrupacion = %.2f m | APLICAR = %s'\n               % (TOLE, TOLA, APL))\n    FASE_EFF = 'LONG+EO' if 'EO' in FASE else 'LONG'\n    p_trans = (P_EO if MODO == 'NS' else P_NS) / 100.0\n    log.append('FASE: %s | p_trans (%s) = %.2f %% | pitch = %.2f +- %.2f m'\n               ' | solape min = %.2f m | max pasadas EO = %d'\n               % ('FORZAR' if FORZAR_M else FASE_EFF,\n                  'EO' if MODO == 'NS' else 'NS',\n                  p_trans * 100.0, PITCH, MPITCH, SOLAPE_MIN, int(MAXP)))\n    log.append('v20: objetivo TIERRAS D/T = %.2f +- %.2f | anclas hasta '\n               '+-TOL_EXTREMOS (coste x10; TOL=0 = fijas) | rugosidad = '\n               '%.2f m | rescate KO: %s'\n               % (RATIO, TOLRAT, RUG,\n                  'OFF' if TOLR <= TOLE else\n                  'TOL_RESCATE = %.2f m' % TOLR))\n    log.append('-' * 70)\n    if p_frac <= 0:\n        log.append('!!!! Pendiente maxima <= 0. Abortado.')\n        return '\\n'.join(log)\n    if not MDT_N:\n        log.append('!!!! Falta el nombre del MDT. Abortado.')\n        return '\\n'.join(log)\n\n    doc = AcadApp.DocumentManager.MdiActiveDocument\n    if doc is None:\n        log.append('!!!! No hay documento activo. Abortado.')\n        return '\\n'.join(log)\n    db = doc.Database\n    cdoc = CivilApplication.ActiveDocument\n\n    lock = doc.LockDocument()\n    tr = db.TransactionManager.StartTransaction()\n    n_escritos = 0\n    n_reanclados = 0\n    rebuild_txt = '(no solicitado)'\n    audit_txt = '(sin rebuild: no aplica)'\n    try:\n        # ------------------------------------------------ LECTURA FLs ----\n        t0 = time.perf_counter()\n        oids = []\n        vistos = set()\n        n_ms = 0\n        n_sites = 0\n        ko_lect = 0\n        try:\n            ms_id = SymbolUtilityServices.GetBlockModelSpaceId(db)\n            btr = tr.GetObject(ms_id, OpenMode.ForRead)\n            for oid in btr:\n                try:\n                    ent = tr.GetObject(oid, OpenMode.ForRead)\n                    if isinstance(ent, FeatureLine) and _match(ent.Name, PATRON):\n                        h = str(ent.Handle)\n                        if h not in vistos:\n                            vistos.add(h)\n                            oids.append(oid)\n                            n_ms += 1\n                except Exception as ex:\n                    ko_lect += 1\n                    log.append('  [KO] lectura entidad ModelSpace: '\n                               + str(ex)[:120])\n        except Exception as ex:\n            log.append('!!!! No se pudo recorrer ModelSpace: ' + str(ex)[:160])\n            return '\\n'.join(log)\n        # Sites (best-effort; las FL_T del pipeline son siteless)\n        try:\n            sids = cdoc.GetSiteIds()\n            for i in range(sids.Count):\n                try:\n                    site = tr.GetObject(sids[i], OpenMode.ForRead)\n                    fl_ids = None\n                    for attr in ('GetFeatureLineIds', 'FeatureLineIds'):\n                        try:\n                            m = getattr(site, attr)\n                            fl_ids = m() if callable(m) else m\n                            if fl_ids is not None:\n                                break\n                        except Exception:\n                            fl_ids = None\n                    if fl_ids is None:\n                        continue\n                    for j in range(fl_ids.Count):\n                        try:\n                            ent = tr.GetObject(fl_ids[j], OpenMode.ForRead)\n                            if isinstance(ent, FeatureLine) and \\\n                                    _match(ent.Name, PATRON):\n                                h = str(ent.Handle)\n                                if h not in vistos:\n                                    vistos.add(h)\n                                    oids.append(fl_ids[j])\n                                    n_sites += 1\n                        except Exception as ex:\n                            ko_lect += 1\n                            log.append('  [KO] FL en Site %d: ' % i\n                                       + str(ex)[:120])\n                except Exception as ex:\n                    log.append('  [i] Site %d no accesible: ' % i\n                               + str(ex)[:100])\n        except Exception as ex:\n            log.append('  [i] Sites no accesibles (no critico): '\n                       + str(ex)[:100])\n        T['Lectura FLs'] = time.perf_counter() - t0\n\n        # ------------------------------------------------ GEOMETRIA ------\n        t0 = time.perf_counter()\n        flz = []\n        n_pis_raros = 0\n        n_flex = 0\n        n_hincas = 0\n        for oid in oids:\n            try:\n                fl = tr.GetObject(oid, OpenMode.ForRead)\n                nm = fl.Name\n                h = str(fl.Handle)\n                pts = _pts_de_fl(fl)\n                npts = len(pts)\n                if npts < 2:\n                    n_pis_raros += 1\n                    log.append('  [KO] %s (%s): %d puntos (<2). Se EXCLUYE.'\n                               % (nm, h, npts))\n                    continue\n                p0, p1 = pts[0], pts[-1]\n                # vertices interiores = HINCAS (tracker FLEXIBLE si hay)\n                hin = [(k, pts[k][0], pts[k][1], pts[k][2])\n                       for k in range(1, npts - 1)]\n                if hin:\n                    n_flex += 1\n                    n_hincas += len(hin)\n                flz.append({'oid': oid, 'nombre': nm, 'handle': h,\n                            'x0': p0[0], 'y0': p0[1], 'zact0': p0[2],\n                            'x1': p1[0], 'y1': p1[1], 'zact1': p1[2],\n                            'i0': 0, 'i1': npts - 1, 'hin': hin})\n            except Exception as ex:\n                ko_lect += 1\n                log.append('  [KO] geometria FL: ' + str(ex)[:120])\n        log.append('FLs candidatas: %d (ModelSpace %d, Sites %d) | '\n                   'KO lectura: %d | excluidas (<2 puntos): %d'\n                   % (len(oids), n_ms, n_sites, ko_lect, n_pis_raros))\n        log.append('Trackers FIJOS (2 vertices): %d | FLEXIBLES (>2): %d '\n                   '| hincas interiores: %d | deflexion hinca/ala: '\n                   '%.2f / %.2f %%'\n                   % (len(flz) - n_flex, n_flex, n_hincas, D_HINCA, D_ALA))\n        if not flz:\n            log.append('!!!! Ninguna FL valida con el patron \"%s\". Abortado.'\n                       % PATRON)\n            return '\\n'.join(log)\n        T['Geometria'] = time.perf_counter() - t0\n\n        # ------------------------------------------------ TERRENO (MDT) --\n        t0 = time.perf_counter()\n        surf_mdt, nombres_sup = _busca_superficie(tr, cdoc, MDT_N)\n        if surf_mdt is None:\n            log.append('!!!! MDT \"%s\" no encontrado. Superficies en el DWG: %s'\n                       % (MDT_N, ', '.join(nombres_sup) if nombres_sup\n                          else '(ninguna)'))\n            return '\\n'.join(log)\n        ko_terr = 0\n        for f in flz:\n            try:\n                f['t0'] = float(surf_mdt.FindElevationAtXY(f['x0'], f['y0']))\n                f['t1'] = float(surf_mdt.FindElevationAtXY(f['x1'], f['y1']))\n                f['hin_t'] = []\n                for (k, hx, hy, hz) in f.get('hin', []):\n                    f['hin_t'].append(\n                        (k, hx, hy,\n                         float(surf_mdt.FindElevationAtXY(hx, hy)), hz))\n                f['ok'] = True\n            except Exception as ex:\n                f['ok'] = False\n                ko_terr += 1\n                log.append('  [KO] %s (%s): sin cota en MDT (%s). Se EXCLUYE;'\n                           ' la cadena se corta ahi.'\n                           % (f['nombre'], f['handle'], str(ex)[:80]))\n        flz = [f for f in flz if f.get('ok')]\n        if ko_terr:\n            log.append('  [i] FLs sin cota MDT excluidas: %d' % ko_terr)\n        if not flz:\n            log.append('!!!! Ninguna FL con cota valida sobre el MDT. '\n                       'Abortado.')\n            return '\\n'.join(log)\n        T['Terreno (MDT)'] = time.perf_counter() - t0\n\n        # ------------------------------------------------ AGRUPACION -----\n        t0 = time.perf_counter()\n        for f in flz:\n            f['xm'] = 0.5 * (f['x0'] + f['x1'])\n            f['ym'] = 0.5 * (f['y0'] + f['y1'])\n        ejes = []\n        if MODO == 'NS':\n            flz.sort(key=lambda f: f['xm'])\n            cur = [flz[0]]\n            for f in flz[1:]:\n                if f['xm'] - cur[-1]['xm'] <= TOLA:\n                    cur.append(f)\n                else:\n                    ejes.append(cur)\n                    cur = [f]\n            ejes.append(cur)\n            for e in ejes:\n                e.sort(key=lambda f: -f['ym'])\n        else:\n            flz.sort(key=lambda f: -f['ym'])\n            cur = [flz[0]]\n            for f in flz[1:]:\n                if cur[-1]['ym'] - f['ym'] <= TOLA:\n                    cur.append(f)\n                else:\n                    ejes.append(cur)\n                    cur = [f]\n            ejes.append(cur)\n            for e in ejes:\n                e.sort(key=lambda f: f['xm'])\n        log.append('Ejes detectados: %d (%s)' % (len(ejes), MODO))\n        log.append('-' * 70)\n        T['Agrupacion ejes'] = time.perf_counter() - t0\n\n        # ------------------------------------------------ OPTIMIZACION ---\n        t0 = time.perf_counter()\n        detalle = []\n        n_det_max = 400\n        tot = {'trk': 0, 'viol': 0, 'corr': 0, 'arr': 0, 'eoaj': 0, 'ok': 0,\n               'ejes_ko': 0, 'ext_mov': 0, 'ext_mov_max': 0.0,\n               'dzmax': 0.0, 'dzmax_id': '', 'desm': 0.0, 'terr': 0.0,\n               'mtd': 0.0, 'mtt': 0.0, 'abs': 0, 'resc': 0,\n               'flex': 0, 'hincas': 0, 'vanos': 0, 'vko_a': 0, 'vko_d': 0,\n               'cko_a': 0, 'cko_d': 0, 'qko_a': 0, 'qko_d': 0,\n               'alko_a': 0, 'alko_d': 0, 'qmx': 0.0, 'almx': 0.0,\n               'hmov': 0, 'habs': 0}\n        planes = []   # (fl_dict, idx, cota) a escribir\n        reset = []    # (fl_dict, idx, cota_terreno) re-anclar a terreno\n        ver_max_p = 0.0\n        ver_max_e = 0.0\n        ejes_trs = []\n        coords_lbl = []\n        for k_eje, e in enumerate(ejes):\n            trs = []\n            for f in e:\n                if MODO == 'NS':\n                    a_first = f['y0'] >= f['y1']\n                else:\n                    a_first = f['x0'] <= f['x1']\n                if a_first:\n                    ax, ay, ta, ia = f['x0'], f['y0'], f['t0'], f['i0']\n                    bx, by, tb, ib = f['x1'], f['y1'], f['t1'], f['i1']\n                    za_act, zb_act = f['zact0'], f['zact1']\n                else:\n                    ax, ay, ta, ia = f['x1'], f['y1'], f['t1'], f['i1']\n                    bx, by, tb, ib = f['x0'], f['y0'], f['t0'], f['i0']\n                    za_act, zb_act = f['zact1'], f['zact0']\n                L = math.hypot(bx - ax, by - ay)\n                hs = list(f.get('hin_t', []))\n                if not a_first:\n                    hs = hs[::-1]\n                trd = {'id': f['nombre'], 'ax': ax, 'ay': ay,\n                       'az_t': ta, 'bx': bx, 'by': by, 'bz_t': tb,\n                       'len': L, '_f': f, '_ia': ia, '_ib': ib,\n                       '_za_act': za_act, '_zb_act': zb_act}\n                if hs:\n                    trd['h'] = [(hx, hy, ht) for (k, hx, hy, ht, hz) in hs]\n                    trd['_hidx'] = [k for (k, hx, hy, ht, hz) in hs]\n                    trd['_hz_act'] = [hz for (k, hx, hy, ht, hz) in hs]\n                trs.append(trd)\n            coord = ('X~%.2f' % (sum(t['ax'] for t in trs) / len(trs))) \\\n                if MODO == 'NS' else \\\n                ('Y~%.2f' % (sum(t['ay'] for t in trs) / len(trs)))\n            ejes_trs.append(trs)\n            coords_lbl.append(coord)\n        ORI_MAL = False\n        dxs = []\n        dys = []\n        for trs in ejes_trs:\n            for t in trs:\n                dxs.append(abs(t['bx'] - t['ax']))\n                dys.append(abs(t['by'] - t['ay']))\n        if dxs:\n            dxs.sort()\n            dys.sort()\n            med_x = dxs[len(dxs) // 2]\n            med_y = dys[len(dys) // 2]\n            if MODO == 'EO' and med_x < med_y:\n                log.append('!! AVISO ORIENTACION: MODO=EO pero las FL se '\n                           'extienden mas en Y (mediana |dY| = %.1f m) que '\n                           'en X (%.1f m). Parecen trackers N-S: '\n                           'probablemente MODO deberia ser NS.'\n                           % (med_y, med_x))\n                ORI_MAL = True\n            elif MODO == 'NS' and med_y < med_x:\n                log.append('!! AVISO ORIENTACION: MODO=NS pero las FL se '\n                           'extienden mas en X (mediana |dX| = %.1f m) que '\n                           'en Y (%.1f m). Parecen filas E-O: '\n                           'probablemente MODO deberia ser EO.'\n                           % (med_x, med_y))\n                ORI_MAL = True\n        if ORI_MAL and APL:\n            APL = False\n            log.append('!' * 66)\n            log.append('!! GUARDARRAIL: aviso de orientacion con '\n                       'APLICAR=True -> SE FUERZA')\n            log.append('!! SIMULACION. NO se escribira nada. Revisa MODO '\n                       'y vuelve a ejecutar.')\n            log.append('!' * 66)\n        # ---- v18: guardarrail de limites sospechosos --------------------\n        try:\n            s_ter = []\n            for trs_g in ejes_trs:\n                for t_g in trs_g:\n                    if t_g['len'] > 0.05:\n                        s_ter.append(abs(t_g['az_t'] - t_g['bz_t'])\n                                     / t_g['len'])\n            if s_ter and p_frac > 0:\n                s_ter.sort()\n                g50 = s_ter[len(s_ter) // 2] * 100.0\n                i85 = int(len(s_ter) * 0.85)\n                if i85 > len(s_ter) - 1:\n                    i85 = len(s_ter) - 1\n                g85 = s_ter[i85] * 100.0\n                if g85 > 2.0 * p_frac * 100.0:\n                    log.append('!' * 66)\n                    log.append('!! GUARDARRAIL DE LIMITES: pendiente '\n                               'longitudinal del terreno bajo')\n                    log.append('!! los trackers: mediana %.1f %% / p85 '\n                               '%.1f %%, frente a un limite'\n                               % (g50, g85))\n                    log.append('!! configurado de %.1f %%. Una diferencia '\n                               'asi suele ser'\n                               % (p_frac * 100.0))\n                    log.append('!! CONFIGURACION, no fisica (leccion '\n                               'Apamate): CONFIRMA que los')\n                    log.append('!! limites de esta planta son realmente '\n                               'NS=%.1f %% / EO=%.1f %%'\n                               % (P_NS, P_EO))\n                    log.append('!! antes de fiarte del resultado.')\n                    log.append('!' * 66)\n                else:\n                    log.append('Guardarrail de limites: terreno long. '\n                               'p50 %.1f %% / p85 %.1f %% vs limite '\n                               '%.1f %% -> coherente.'\n                               % (g50, g85, p_frac * 100.0))\n        except Exception as ex_g:\n            log.append('(guardarrail de limites no disponible: %s)'\n                       % str(ex_g)[:80])\n        if FORZAR_M:\n            rp, RECETA = procesar_planta_forzar(\n                ejes_trs, MODO, p_frac, p_trans, ESC, GAPC, TOLE, PITCH,\n                MPITCH, SOLAPE_MIN, int(MAXP), rug_m=RUG,\n                tol_rescate=TOLR, p_hincas=None)\n            RINF = {'activo': False,\n                    'nota': 'modo FORZAR: objetivo de tierras '\n                            'desactivado'}\n        else:\n            RECETA = None\n            rp, RINF = procesar_planta_ratio(\n                ejes_trs, MODO, p_frac, p_trans, ESC, GAPC, TOLE, PITCH,\n                MPITCH, SOLAPE_MIN, FASE_EFF, int(MAXP), ratio_obj=RATIO,\n                ratio_tol=TOLRAT, rug_m=RUG, tol_rescate=TOLR, p_hincas=None)\n        eo = rp['eo']\n        for k_eje, trs in enumerate(ejes_trs):\n            coord = coords_lbl[k_eje]\n            r = rp['ejes'][k_eje]\n            if r['status'] == 'KO':\n                tot['ejes_ko'] += 1\n                tot['trk'] += len(trs)\n                log.append('EJE %02d %s | %d trk | KO NO RESUELTO: %s'\n                           % (k_eje + 1, coord, len(trs), r['msg']))\n                continue\n            st = r['stats']\n            tot['trk'] += len(trs)\n            tot['viol'] += st['violaban']\n            tot['corr'] += st['corregidos']\n            tot['arr'] += st['arrastrados']\n            tot['eoaj'] += st.get('ajuste_eo', 0)\n            tot['ok'] += st['sin_tocar']\n            tot['desm'] += st['suma_desmonte']\n            tot['terr'] += st['suma_terraplen']\n            tot['mtd'] += st.get('mt_desmonte', 0.0)\n            tot['mtt'] += st.get('mt_terraplen', 0.0)\n            tot['abs'] += st.get('absorbidos', 0)\n            tot['flex'] += st.get('flex', 0)\n            tot['hincas'] += st.get('hincas', 0)\n            tot['vanos'] += st.get('vanos', 0)\n            tot['vko_a'] += st.get('vanos_ko_antes', 0)\n            tot['vko_d'] += st.get('vanos_ko_despues', 0)\n            tot['cko_a'] += st.get('cuerda_ko_antes', 0)\n            tot['cko_d'] += st.get('cuerda_ko_despues', 0)\n            tot['qko_a'] += st.get('q_ko_a', 0)\n            tot['qko_d'] += st.get('q_ko_d', 0)\n            tot['alko_a'] += st.get('ala_ko_a', 0)\n            tot['alko_d'] += st.get('ala_ko_d', 0)\n            if st.get('qmax_d', 0.0) > tot['qmx']:\n                tot['qmx'] = st['qmax_d']\n            if st.get('alamax_d', 0.0) > tot['almx']:\n                tot['almx'] = st['alamax_d']\n            tot['hmov'] += st.get('hincas_movidas', 0)\n            tot['habs'] += st.get('h_absorbidos', 0)\n            if abs(st['dz_max']) > abs(tot['dzmax']):\n                tot['dzmax'] = st['dz_max']\n                tot['dzmax_id'] = st['dz_max_id']\n            anc = r['anc']\n            etq_a = 'fijo' if anc['a_mov'] is None else '%+0.2f m (ancla)' \\\n                % anc['a_mov']\n            etq_b = 'fijo' if anc['b_mov'] is None else '%+0.2f m (ancla)' \\\n                % anc['b_mov']\n            for mv in (anc['a_mov'], anc['b_mov']):\n                if mv is not None:\n                    tot['ext_mov'] += 1\n                    if abs(mv) > tot['ext_mov_max']:\n                        tot['ext_mov_max'] = abs(mv)\n            lado = ('N', 'S') if MODO == 'NS' else ('O', 'E')\n            if st['violaban'] or st['corregidos'] or st['arrastrados'] \\\n                    or st.get('ajuste_eo', 0) or anc['a_mov'] is not None \\\n                    or anc['b_mov'] is not None or st['subcadenas'] > 1:\n                log.append('EJE %02d %s | %d trk | subcad %d | violaban %d |'\n                           ' corrige %d | arrastre %d | eo %d | sin tocar %d'\n                           ' | dZmax %+0.2f | extremos: %s %s / %s %s'\n                           % (k_eje + 1, coord, len(trs), st['subcadenas'],\n                              st['violaban'], st['corregidos'],\n                              st['arrastrados'], st.get('ajuste_eo', 0),\n                              st['sin_tocar'], st['dz_max'],\n                              lado[0], etq_a, lado[1], etq_b))\n            else:\n                log.append('EJE %02d %s | %d trk | conforme, sin tocar'\n                           % (k_eje + 1, coord, len(trs)))\n            if r.get('rescate'):\n                rc = r['rescate']\n                tot['resc'] += 1\n                log.append('        RESCATADO: %s (TOL %.2f m%s)'\n                           % ('anclas ampliadas' if rc['tipo'] == 'ANCLAS'\n                              else 'pendiente minima factible',\n                              rc['tol'],\n                              '' if rc['tipo'] == 'ANCLAS' else\n                              ', p lograda = %.2f %%'\n                              % (rc['p_eff'] * 100.0)))\n            p_ver = r['rescate']['p_eff'] if r.get('rescate') else p_frac\n            eff = []\n            for tr_d, res in zip(trs, r['res']):\n                f = tr_d['_f']\n                ea = res['za'] if res['wa'] else tr_d['az_t']\n                eb = res['zb'] if res['wb'] else tr_d['bz_t']\n                if res['wa']:\n                    planes.append((f, tr_d['_ia'], res['za']))\n                elif abs(tr_d['_za_act'] - tr_d['az_t']) > 0.005:\n                    reset.append((f, tr_d['_ia'], tr_d['az_t']))\n                if res['wb']:\n                    planes.append((f, tr_d['_ib'], res['zb']))\n                elif abs(tr_d['_zb_act'] - tr_d['bz_t']) > 0.005:\n                    reset.append((f, tr_d['_ib'], tr_d['bz_t']))\n                if res.get('flex') and tr_d.get('_hidx'):\n                    for q, k_pi in enumerate(tr_d['_hidx']):\n                        h_t = tr_d['h'][q][2]\n                        if abs(res['hdz'][q]) > 1e-9:\n                            planes.append((f, k_pi, res['hz'][q]))\n                        elif abs(tr_d['_hz_act'][q] - h_t) > 0.005:\n                            reset.append((f, k_pi, h_t))\n                eff.append((ea, eb))\n                exceso = abs(ea - eb) - (p_ver * tr_d['len'] + 0.006)\n                if exceso > ver_max_p:\n                    ver_max_p = exceso\n                if res['clase'] in ('CORRIGE', 'ARRASTRE', 'EO'):\n                    if len(detalle) < n_det_max:\n                        detalle.append(\n                            '    EJE %02d %s (%s) %5.2f%% -> %5.2f%%  '\n                            'dA=%+0.2f dB=%+0.2f  %s'\n                            % (k_eje + 1, tr_d['id'], f['handle'],\n                               res['s_antes'] * 100.0,\n                               res['s_despues'] * 100.0,\n                               res['dza'], res['dzb'], res['clase']))\n            for i in range(len(trs) - 1):\n                g = math.hypot(trs[i + 1]['ax'] - trs[i]['bx'],\n                               trs[i + 1]['ay'] - trs[i]['by'])\n                if g <= GAPC:\n                    nat = abs(trs[i]['bz_t'] - trs[i + 1]['az_t'])\n                    d = abs(eff[i][1] - eff[i + 1][0])\n                    exceso = d - (max(ESC, nat) + 0.006)\n                    if exceso > ver_max_e:\n                        ver_max_e = exceso\n        T['Optimizacion'] = time.perf_counter() - t0\n        if detalle:\n            log.append('-' * 70)\n            log.append('DETALLE (solo trackers modificados; max %d lineas):'\n                       % n_det_max)\n            log.extend(detalle)\n            resto = tot['corr'] + tot['arr'] + tot['eoaj'] - len(detalle)\n            if resto > 0:\n                log.append('    ... y %d modificados mas (no listados)'\n                           % resto)\n        if eo['activa']:\n            log.append('-' * 70)\n            log.append('FASE EO: pares %d | pasadas %d%s | estado adoptado:'\n                       ' pasada %s | nodos movidos por EO: %d'\n                       % (eo['pares'], eo['pasadas'],\n                          '' if eo['convergio'] else\n                          ' (tope/ciclo, sin converger del todo)',\n                          eo.get('mejor_pasada', '-'),\n                          eo['nodos_movidos_eo']))\n            log.append('         relajaciones %d | exigencias descartadas %d'\n                       ' | col. sin resolver %d | etapa solo-desmonte: '\n                       '%s pasadas'\n                       % (eo['relajaciones'], eo.get('descartes', 0),\n                          eo['col_sin_resolver'],\n                          eo.get('pasadas_desmonte', 0)))\n            if eo.get('wl_potencial'):\n                ah = 100.0 * (1.0 - float(eo['wl_resueltas'])\n                              / eo['wl_potencial'])\n                log.append('         WORK-LIST (v19): %d columnas '\n                           'resueltas de %d posibles (ahorro %.0f %%)'\n                           % (eo['wl_resueltas'], eo['wl_potencial'],\n                              ah))\n            if eo.get('pares_punta'):\n                log.append('         pares en punta/diagonal (escalones): %d'\n                           ' de %d' % (eo['pares_punta'], eo['pares']))\n            if eo.get('arrastre_casc'):\n                log.append('         ARRASTRE transversal: %d cascadas | %d '\n                           'desplazamientos de columna | max %.2f m'\n                           % (eo['arrastre_casc'], eo['arrastre_cols'],\n                              eo['arrastre_max']))\n            psw = eo.get('peine_sw')\n            if psw:\n                log.append('         PEINE EO (v19, barridos intermedios):'\n                           ' %d barridos | filas %d (%d aplicadas) | '\n                           'mesas %d (max %.2f m)'\n                           % (psw.get('barridos', 0), psw['filas'],\n                              psw['aplicadas'], psw['mesas_movidas'],\n                              psw['dmax']))\n            pe = eo.get('peine')\n            if pe is not None:\n                if pe.get('error'):\n                    log.append('         PEINE EO (v18): ERROR %s'\n                               % pe['error'])\n                elif pe.get('kos_ini', 0) > 0:\n                    log.append('         PEINE EO (v18, rescate por filas):'\n                               ' KOs %d -> %d | filas %d (%d aplicadas)'\n                               % (pe['kos_ini'], pe['kos_fin'],\n                                  pe['filas'], pe['aplicadas']))\n                    if pe.get('aplicadas'):\n                        log.append('                  mesas movidas %d | '\n                                   'delta max %.2f m | ampliaciones %d | '\n                                   'DP infactibles %d'\n                                   % (pe['mesas_movidas'], pe['dmax'],\n                                      pe['ampliaciones'],\n                                      pe['infactibles']))\n            if eo['pares'] == 0:\n                log.append('   !! 0 pares detectados: ninguna pareja de '\n                           'mesas vecinas cumple ventana y solape. Revisa '\n                           'MODO (orientacion de las FL), PITCH +- MARGEN '\n                           '(ventana actual %.2f - %.2f m) y SOLAPE_MIN '\n                           '(%.2f m).'\n                           % (PITCH - MPITCH, PITCH + MPITCH, SOLAPE_MIN))\n            if eo['ko_pares']:\n                log.append('!! PARES EO NO RESUELTOS: %d (tipicos: entre '\n                           'extremos anclados a terreno)'\n                           % len(eo['ko_pares']))\n                for k in eo['ko_pares'][:80]:\n                    log.append('    EJE %02d %s <-> EJE %02d %s en s=%.2f: '\n                               'dZ=%.2f > lim %.2f (exceso %.2f m)'\n                               % (k['ea'] + 1, k['ida'], k['eb'] + 1,\n                                  k['idb'], k['s'], k['dz'], k['lim'],\n                                  k['exceso']))\n                if len(eo['ko_pares']) > 80:\n                    log.append('    ... y %d mas'\n                               % (len(eo['ko_pares']) - 80))\n            else:\n                log.append('   Todos los pares EO cumplen (holgura 11 mm).')\n            rc = eo.get('rescate', {})\n            if rc.get('activo'):\n                log.append('FASE RESCATE (TOL_RESCATE %.2f m): %d pares KO '\n                           'objetivo -> %d resueltos | %d ejes con anclas '\n                           'ampliadas | %d pasadas extra'\n                           % (TOLR, rc['pares_obj'], rc['resueltos'],\n                              rc['ejes'], rc['pasadas']))\n            aus = eo.get('autopsias') or []\n            if aus:\n                log.append('AUTOPSIA DE PARES KO (por que no se corrigen):')\n                for i2, a in enumerate(aus):\n                    log.append(' %d) %s(ALTO) <-> %s(BAJO) en s=%.1f | '\n                               'salto %.2f | lim %.2f | cierre necesario '\n                               '%.2f m'\n                               % (i2 + 1, a['ida'], a['idb'], a['s'],\n                                  a['dz'], a['lim'], a['exceso']))\n                    log.append('    ALTO %s: puede bajar %.2f m  '\n                               '[limita: %s]'\n                               % (a['ida'], a['mov_alto'], a['lim_alto']))\n                    if a['vecinos_alto']:\n                        log.append('         pares mas justos: ' + ' | '\n                                   .join('%s %.2f m' % v\n                                         for v in a['vecinos_alto']))\n                    log.append('    BAJO %s: puede subir %.2f m  '\n                               '[limita: %s]'\n                               % (a['idb'], a['mov_bajo'], a['lim_bajo']))\n                    if a['vecinos_bajo']:\n                        log.append('         pares mas justos: ' + ' | '\n                                   .join('%s %.2f m' % v\n                                         for v in a['vecinos_bajo']))\n                    if a['faltan'] > 0:\n                        log.append('    VEREDICTO: movilidad %.2f + %.2f '\n                                   '= %.2f < %.2f -> FALTAN %.2f m: '\n                                   'ESTRUCTURAL (implantacion, talud o '\n                                   'mas TOL a sabiendas)'\n                                   % (a['mov_alto'], a['mov_bajo'],\n                                      a['mov_alto'] + a['mov_bajo'],\n                                      a['exceso'], a['faltan']))\n                    else:\n                        pe_a = eo.get('peine') or {}\n                        if pe_a and not pe_a.get('error'):\n                            log.append('    VEREDICTO: la movilidad '\n                                       'alcanza (%.2f >= %.2f) pero el '\n                                       'acople NO converge ni con el '\n                                       'PEINE EO -> subir MAX_PASADAS o '\n                                       'TOL ya NO ayuda: implantacion o '\n                                       'retoque manual local (cuna E-O)'\n                                       % (a['mov_alto'] + a['mov_bajo'],\n                                          a['exceso']))\n                        else:\n                            log.append('    VEREDICTO: la movilidad '\n                                       'alcanza (%.2f >= %.2f) -> residuo '\n                                       'de acople fino: sube MAX_PASADAS '\n                                       'o TOL_RESCATE'\n                                       % (a['mov_alto'] + a['mov_bajo'],\n                                          a['exceso']))\n\n        # ------------------------------------------------ ESCRITURA ------\n        t0 = time.perf_counter()\n        if APL:\n            for f, idx, cota in planes:\n                try:\n                    fl = tr.GetObject(f['oid'], OpenMode.ForWrite)\n                    fl.SetPointElevation(idx, float(cota))\n                    n_escritos += 1\n                except Exception as ex:\n                    log.append('  [KO] escritura %s (%s) idx %d: %s'\n                               % (f['nombre'], f['handle'], idx,\n                                  str(ex)[:100]))\n            for f, idx, cota in reset:\n                try:\n                    fl = tr.GetObject(f['oid'], OpenMode.ForWrite)\n                    fl.SetPointElevation(idx, float(cota))\n                    n_reanclados += 1\n                except Exception as ex:\n                    log.append('  [KO] re-anclaje %s (%s) idx %d: %s'\n                               % (f['nombre'], f['handle'], idx,\n                                  str(ex)[:100]))\n        T['Escritura'] = time.perf_counter() - t0\n\n        # ------------------------------------------------ REBUILD --------\n        t0 = time.perf_counter()\n        surf_tr_obj = None\n        if APL and SUP_TR and (n_escritos + n_reanclados) > 0:\n            try:\n                surf_tr_obj, _ = _busca_superficie(tr, cdoc, SUP_TR)\n                if surf_tr_obj is None:\n                    rebuild_txt = 'KO: superficie \"%s\" no encontrada' % SUP_TR\n                else:\n                    s_w = tr.GetObject(surf_tr_obj.ObjectId,\n                                       OpenMode.ForWrite)\n                    s_w.Rebuild()\n                    rebuild_txt = 'OK'\n            except Exception as ex:\n                rebuild_txt = 'KO: ' + str(ex)[:140]\n        elif APL and SUP_TR:\n            rebuild_txt = '(sin cambios: no necesario)'\n        elif APL:\n            rebuild_txt = '(nombre vacio: omitido)'\n        T['Rebuild'] = time.perf_counter() - t0\n\n        # ------------------------------------------------ AUDITORIA Z ----\n        t0 = time.perf_counter()\n        if APL and rebuild_txt == 'OK' and surf_tr_obj is not None:\n            try:\n                zs = []\n                xy_min = (0.0, 0.0)\n                zmin = None\n                en = surf_tr_obj.Vertices.GetEnumerator()\n                while en.MoveNext():\n                    v = en.Current\n                    z = v.Location.Z\n                    zs.append(z)\n                    if zmin is None or z < zmin:\n                        zmin = z\n                        xy_min = (v.Location.X, v.Location.Y)\n                if zs:\n                    zs.sort()\n                    med = zs[len(zs) // 2]\n                    if zmin < med - 50.0:\n                        audit_txt = ('!!!!!! AUDITORIA Z: vertice anomalo '\n                                     'Z=%.2f en (%.2f, %.2f); mediana %.2f. '\n                                     'SUPERFICIE NO VALIDA.'\n                                     % (zmin, xy_min[0], xy_min[1], med))\n                    else:\n                        audit_txt = ('AUDITORIA Z: OK (n=%d, min=%.2f, '\n                                     'mediana=%.2f)' % (len(zs), zmin, med))\n                else:\n                    audit_txt = 'AUDITORIA Z: superficie sin vertices (?)'\n            except Exception as ex:\n                audit_txt = 'AUDITORIA Z: KO ' + str(ex)[:140]\n        T['Auditoria Z'] = time.perf_counter() - t0\n\n        if APL:\n            tr.Commit()\n        else:\n            tr.Abort()\n    except Exception:\n        try:\n            tr.Abort()\n        except Exception:\n            pass\n        log.append('!!!! EXCEPCION:')\n        log.append(traceback.format_exc())\n        return '\\n'.join(log)\n    finally:\n        try:\n            tr.Dispose()\n        except Exception:\n            pass\n        try:\n            lock.Dispose()\n        except Exception:\n            pass\n\n    # ---------------------------------------------------- RESUMEN --------\n    log.append('-' * 70)\n    log.append('RESUMEN GLOBAL')\n    log.append('  Ejes: %d (OK %d, KO NO RESUELTO %d) | Trackers: %d'\n               % (len(ejes), len(ejes) - tot['ejes_ko'], tot['ejes_ko'],\n                  tot['trk']))\n    log.append('  Violaban pendiente: %d | Corregidos: %d | Arrastrados: %d'\n               ' | Ajuste EO: %d | Sin tocar: %d'\n               % (tot['viol'], tot['corr'], tot['arr'], tot['eoaj'],\n                  tot['ok']))\n    log.append('  Extremos exteriores movidos: %d (max %.2f m) | '\n               'dZ max global: %+0.2f m (%s)'\n               % (tot['ext_mov'], tot['ext_mov_max'], tot['dzmax'],\n                  tot['dzmax_id'] if tot['dzmax_id'] else '-'))\n    if tot['flex']:\n        log.append('  HINCAS (flexibles): %d mesas | %d hincas | %d vanos | '\n                   'vanos KO antes %d -> despues %d | CUERDA vs p_max long: '\n                   'KO antes %d -> despues %d | hincas movidas %d '\n                   '(absorbidas por rugosidad %d)'\n                   % (tot['flex'], tot['hincas'], tot['vanos'], tot['vko_a'],\n                      tot['vko_d'], tot['cko_a'], tot['cko_d'], tot['hmov'],\n                      tot['habs']))\n        log.append('  DEFLEXIONES: quiebros KO antes %d -> despues %d '\n                   '(max final %.2f %%) | ALAS (motora excluida) KO antes '\n                   '%d -> despues %d (max final %.2f %%)'\n                   % (tot['qko_a'], tot['qko_d'], tot['qmx'] * 100.0,\n                      tot['alko_a'], tot['alko_d'], tot['almx'] * 100.0))\n        try:\n            dfx = eo.get('deflex')\n        except Exception:\n            dfx = None\n        conf_txt = ''\n        if dfx and 'pares_ko_antes' in dfx:\n            conf_txt = (' | RECONCILIACION EO: shifts %d (max %.2f m), '\n                        'pares KO %d -> %d'\n                        % (dfx.get('shifts', 0), dfx.get('shift_max', 0.0),\n                           dfx.get('pares_ko_antes', 0),\n                           dfx.get('pares_ko_despues', 0)))\n        if dfx and 'error' in dfx:\n            log.append('  !! PULIDO DEFLEXIONES fallo: %s' % dfx['error'])\n        elif dfx:\n            log.append('  PULIDO: %d mesas ajustadas (%d hincas, dZ max '\n                       '%.3f m, %d rectificadas al maximo) en %d ejes%s'\n                       % (dfx['trackers_pulidos'],\n                          dfx['hincas_ajustadas'],\n                          dfx['dz_max_pulido'], dfx['rectos'],\n                          dfx['ejes_tocados'], conf_txt))\n        log.append('  Deflexiones finales: quiebros KO %d | alas KO %d%s'\n                   % (tot['qko_d'], tot['alko_d'],\n                      ' -> OK' if not (tot['qko_d'] or tot['alko_d'])\n                      else ' -> !! NO RESUELTAS (guardia de solape en los '\n                           'ejes en conflicto o hincas insuficientes para '\n                           'el quiebro del terreno)'))\n    log.append('  Suma |dZ| en puntos (no son m3): desmonte %.2f m | '\n               'terraplen %.2f m' % (tot['desm'], tot['terr']))\n    log.append('  MOV. TIERRAS (descontada rugosidad %.2f m): desmonte '\n               '%.2f m | terraplen %.2f m | puntos absorbidos por la '\n               'hinca: %d' % (RUG, tot['mtd'], tot['mtt'], tot['abs']))\n    ver_ok_p = ver_max_p <= 1e-9\n    ver_ok_e = ver_max_e <= 1e-9\n    log.append('  Verificacion final (holgura 6 mm por anclaje exacto a '\n               'terreno): pendientes %s | juntas %s'\n               % ('OK' if ver_ok_p else\n                  '!! REVISAR (exceso %.3f m)' % ver_max_p,\n                  'OK' if ver_ok_e else\n                  '!! REVISAR (exceso %.3f m)' % ver_max_e))\n    if RECETA is not None:\n        log.append('MODO FORZAR - RECETA VERIFICADA:')\n        for tl, ps, nk, ex in RECETA['intentos']:\n            log.append('   intento TOL_RESCATE=%.2f MAX_PASADAS=%d -> '\n                       'KOs %d (exceso %.2f)' % (tl, ps, nk, ex))\n        if RECETA['cumple']:\n            log.append('   CUMPLE TODA LA PLANTA con TOL_RESCATE=%.2f y '\n                       'MAX_PASADAS_EO=%d (iniciales: %.2f / %d). Resto '\n                       'de inputs: los actuales.'\n                       % (RECETA['tol_fin'], RECETA['pas_fin'],\n                          RECETA['tol_ini'], RECETA['pas_ini']))\n        else:\n            log.append('   NO CUMPLE TODO: quedan %d KO -> implantacion: '\n                       '%s' % (RECETA['kos'],\n                               ', '.join('%s<->%s' % p for p in\n                                         RECETA['irreducibles'][:5])))\n            kos_b = eo.get('ko_pares') or []\n            exc_tot = 0.0\n            peor = None\n            for k_b in kos_b:\n                exc_tot += k_b['exceso']\n                if peor is None or k_b['exceso'] > peor['exceso']:\n                    peor = k_b\n            log.append('!' * 70)\n            log.append('!!')\n            log.append('!!   IMPOSIBLE CUMPLIR EL 100% CON ESTOS LIMITES '\n                       'Y TOPES')\n            log.append('!!   (verificado: FORZAR escalado + PEINE EO '\n                       'agotados)')\n            log.append('!!')\n            log.append('!!   KOs irreducibles: %d | exceso total %.2f m%s'\n                       % (RECETA['kos'], exc_tot,\n                          (' | peor: %s<->%s (%.2f m en s=%.1f)'\n                           % (peor['ida'], peor['idb'], peor['exceso'],\n                              peor['s'])) if peor is not None else ''))\n            log.append('!!   MEJOR ESFUERZO %s: el resultado de ESTA '\n                       'corrida'\n                       % ('APLICADO' if APL else\n                          'DISPONIBLE (dry-run: APLICAR=True para '\n                          'escribirlo)'))\n            log.append('!!   (todo lo demas cumple). Salidas: '\n                       'implantacion en los pares')\n            log.append('!!   listados, explanacion/terraceo local o '\n                       'aceptar el exceso residual.')\n            log.append('!!')\n            log.append('!' * 70)\n    elif (eo.get('ko_pares')\n          or any(r.get('status') == 'KO' for r in rp['ejes'])):\n        rt = eo.get('receta_tol_total')\n        rpas = eo.get('receta_pasadas') or int(MAXP)\n        if rt is not None or rpas > int(MAXP):\n            log.append('RECETA ESTIMADA para cumplir toda la planta: '\n                       'TOL_RESCATE ~ %s | MAX_PASADAS_EO ~ %d | resto '\n                       'de inputs: los actuales. Verificable con '\n                       'FASE=FORZAR.'\n                       % (('%.2f m' % rt) if rt is not None\n                          else ('%.2f m (actual)' % TOLR), rpas))\n        else:\n            log.append('RECETA: ninguna combinacion de palancas cumple '\n                       'todo -> implantacion en los pares listados '\n                       '(FASE=FORZAR lo confirmaria).')\n            log.append('!' * 70)\n            log.append('!!  PROBABLE IMPOSIBILIDAD CON ESTOS LIMITES '\n                       '(estimacion estatica):')\n            log.append('!!  ninguna palanca llega. Confirmalo con '\n                       'FORZAR=True; el resultado')\n            log.append('!!  actual queda como MEJOR ESFUERZO %s.'\n                       % ('APLICADO' if APL else 'de la simulacion'))\n            log.append('!' * 70)\n    hay_ko_esc = bool(eo.get('ko_pares')) or any(\n        r.get('status') == 'KO' for r in rp['ejes'])\n    if RECETA is None and hay_ko_esc:\n        t_esc = time.perf_counter()\n        filas_esc = escenarios_comparativos(\n            ejes_trs, MODO, p_frac, p_trans, ESC, GAPC, PITCH, MPITCH,\n            SOLAPE_MIN, int(MAXP), 10, RUG, TOLE, TOLR, rp, p_hincas=None)\n        log.append('ESCENARIOS COMPARATIVOS (resueltos de verdad, NO '\n                   'aplicados; ratio off en los casos):')\n        for f in filas_esc:\n            etq = 'CUMPLE' if f['kos'] == 0 else 'KOs %d' % f['kos']\n            rat = (f['D'] / f['T']) if f['T'] > 1e-9 else 0.0\n            log.append('  %-7s EXTREMO %.2f / RESCATE %.2f (pasadas %d)'\n                       ' -> %-7s | tierras %.2f/%.2f%s | anclas %d '\n                       '(max %.2f) | dZmax %.2f'\n                       % (f['nombre'], f['ext'], f['resc'], f['pas'],\n                          etq, f['D'], f['T'],\n                          (' (D/T %.2f)' % rat) if f['T'] > 1e-9 else '',\n                          f['anc_n'], f['anc_max'], f['dzmax']))\n        if any(f['kos'] > filas_esc[0]['kos'] for f in filas_esc[1:]):\n            log.append('  NOTA: algun caso sale peor que REAL; el motor '\n                       'es iterativo (no monotono con mas libertad).')\n        ok_f = [f for f in filas_esc if f['kos'] == 0]\n        if ok_f:\n            mejor_f = min(ok_f, key=lambda f: (f['D'] + f['T']))\n            log.append('  -> cumple con menos tierras: %s (EXTREMO %.2f '\n                       '/ RESCATE %.2f)'\n                       % (mejor_f['nombre'], mejor_f['ext'],\n                          mejor_f['resc']))\n        else:\n            log.append('  -> ningun escenario cumple del todo: ver '\n                       'AUTOPSIA / IMPLANTACION.')\n        T['Escenarios'] = time.perf_counter() - t_esc\n    recs = eo.get('recos') or []\n    if recs:\n        log.append('QUE TOCAR (prioridad P1 MAX_PASADAS_EO -> P2 TOL_RESCATE -> '\n                   'P3 TOL_EXTREMOS -> IMPLANTACION; estimacion estatica, '\n                   'verificar en dry-run):')\n    if RINF.get('activo'):\n        def _fr(r):\n            if r < 0:\n                return 'n/a'\n            if r == float('inf') or r > 900:\n                return 'inf'\n            return '%.2f' % r\n        log.append('  OBJETIVO DE TIERRAS D/T = %.2f +- %.2f -> logrado %s '\n                   '%s [%d optimizaciones]'\n                   % (RINF['objetivo'], RINF['tol'], _fr(RINF['logrado']),\n                      '(EN BANDA)' if RINF['en_banda'] else\n                      '!! ' + RINF['nota'], RINF['iteraciones']))\n        log.append('    intentos corte/relleno -> ratio: ' + ' | '.join(\n            '%d/%d -> %s' % (a, b, _fr(r))\n            for a, b, r, _, _ in RINF['historial']))\n        if not RINF['en_banda'] and RINF.get('logrado', -1.0) >= 0 \\\n                and RINF['logrado'] != float('inf'):\n            log.append('    -> acepta el %.2f logrado o pon RATIO=0 '\n                       '(tierras totales: %.2f m en puntos).'\n                       % (RINF['logrado'],\n                          RINF.get('D', 0.0) + RINF.get('T', 0.0)))\n    if tot.get('resc'):\n        log.append('  Ejes RESCATADOS (condiciones ampliadas): %d'\n                   % tot['resc'])\n    if eo['activa']:\n        log.append('  Pares EO: %s'\n                   % ('todos cumplen' if not eo['ko_pares'] else\n                      '%d NO resueltos (ver bloque FASE EO)'\n                      % len(eo['ko_pares'])))\n    if APL:\n        log.append('  Extremos escritos: %d | Re-anclados a terreno: %d'\n                   % (n_escritos, n_reanclados))\n        log.append('  Rebuild \"%s\": %s' % (SUP_TR if SUP_TR else '-',\n                                           rebuild_txt))\n        log.append('  ' + audit_txt)\n    else:\n        log.append('  SIMULACION (APLICAR=False): NO se ha modificado nada.')\n        log.append('  Pendientes de escribir si aplicas: %d extremos '\n                   'corregidos + %d re-anclajes a terreno'\n                   % (len(planes), len(reset)))\n    log.append('')\n    log.append('==== RESUMEN DE TIEMPOS ====')\n    for k in ('Lectura FLs', 'Geometria', 'Terreno (MDT)', 'Agrupacion ejes',\n              'Optimizacion', 'Escenarios', 'Escritura', 'Rebuild',\n              'Auditoria Z'):\n        if k in T:\n            log.append('  {:<27}{:>7.2f} s'.format(k, T[k]))\n    log.append('  {:<27}{:>7.2f} s'.format('TOTAL',\n                                           time.perf_counter() - t00))\n    try:\n        import os\n        try:\n            from Autodesk.AutoCAD.ApplicationServices import \\\n                Application as _App\n            carpeta = os.path.dirname(\n                _App.DocumentManager.MdiActiveDocument.Name)\n        except Exception:\n            carpeta = ''\n        if not carpeta or not os.path.isdir(carpeta):\n            carpeta = os.environ.get('TEMP', '.')\n        ruta_log = os.path.join(\n            carpeta, '3_CorreccionPendientes_log_%s_%d.txt'\n            % (time.strftime('%Y%m%d_%H%M%S'), os.getpid()))\n        fh = open(ruta_log, 'w', encoding='utf-8')\n        fh.write('\\n'.join(log))\n        fh.close()\n        log.append('')\n        log.append('LOG GUARDADO EN: ' + ruta_log)\n    except Exception as ex:\n        log.append('(no se pudo guardar el log a fichero: '\n                   + str(ex)[:80] + ')')\n    return '\\n'.join(log)\n\n\nOUT = run()\n",
